<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Wed Feb 05 2020 17:05:33 GMT-0500 (EST) tc</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luke ne Raukegai Samliakeyi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk.</para>
  <para style="mt">Luke</para>
  <para style="mt">Luke Samliakeyi</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Luke, Samliakeyi kwakdung kakde tietube, de Bata laisiukwak raukegaibe ne ranggai. Luke kaurau pie kegaidau pa maci hemisüt kecume ge, pa Greekme ge miakpie caisui eh rangai. Luke pe laisiukwak ga perwak kereiemdai ga peu anuide Jisu teilung ha kesangbe nah cangsiak kecu cilu kerane raugai lalie eh ranggai. Pa rau cangsiak kegai tei, pe teilung riasiak gade.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiukwak aide kerau ga Luke kecet liecai Jisu au mina pelane de ku lalie kecude. Pa au Khrista pecu keredau nah resiu kegaime mipui zi de nah penui ha de rau kegai tei. Pa au Samliakeyi keda ga swade hename dage pe lung kaiki kecu teigai. Keraide samgwadung ga, pa kegahme nah mine teikeherei kelame ha raugai. Luke au Jisu herasam ga mina ge kesang pa “gah kedime de peei nah kelilu kera gwanglie (19:10)” eh ranggai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiukwak aide pelane ga misuikeyi samdi dele kepui tei-Mary lei gade nah kekamle tinggimgwame Jisu de mna kelu gade ledeukelume Khrista cuh kedicai penui “suiyisüt eh Jerusalem ga cailigwang” kedi. Luke ai Khrista samliakeyi de ranglia nah pa kegwang dene kemau deu aika suiyi nah keregui nah kelikelu de si lie eh rau mcigi liagai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io">Mraisam (1:1-4)</para>
  <para style="io">Duipumketeibe John nah Jisu de kemna nah hena dau (1:5-2:52)</para>
  <para style="io">Duipumketeibe John bata (3:1-20)</para>
  <para style="io">Jisu de duipum teikelu nah kehedei (3:21-4:12)</para>
  <para style="io">Jisu mide keledeu nah teikengkei ta (4:13-9:50)</para>
  <para style="io">Jisu bata (9:51-18:30)</para>
  <para style="io">Jisu keherei nah gwakkedi (18:31-23:56)</para>
  <para style="io">Ringcuhkecu nah cuhkedi (24:1-53).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Mina kekiee ge, anui kakgade tei cang kelu hadung de hekwalu kera teidi, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />cidungde penui raitu gade kengaumedung nah samliakeyi kilamedung ne anuide rangkebeu nzwa eh, <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />cide a ziemne de yi kera cet lulie, raitu gade maleune de ncet siakdelu eh, n dage maha aide rausiak de gai kera, yikemtingbe Theophilus, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />iciu eh ncu ledeu kebeudung de nang kesangsiakbe cilu kerane.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Duipumketeibe John de kemna ha mraikerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Judea deuceu gwangpei, Herod tingdau, Abijah kiria gade kegwang cingkupei ge pezi Zechariah bamla. Nah pe nau cai cingkupei Aaron leuhme gade, pe zi cai Elizabeth. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Nah penai hangnana au Tinggwang dwade masang eh Rampaube ajadung nah zaidung pelane mzai eh kemau gah eh tetla. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Dede penai hena gah, kedanemene Elizabeth nagahpui ge kecune, nah penai hangnana cingdi kecune.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Nah cinzwa eh Tinggwang dwa ga pa cingku ta tei kebam dau, pe maame ratak ketei mlia ting ga, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />cingku teilung zai rehi gade, Rampaube kerecaki ga lüt eh marim kehengui ru kerane pecu dacak tei eh kedetlu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:7">Tet. 30:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Cu mina maabe pelane hegwale de marim kehengui ratak ketei tingdau kekie tei bam. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Cidau Rampaube samgwame ge peu pecu ngau gai, kehengui recabam zetle saplu eh. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Nah Zechariah pecu ngau kegaidau pecu kebwakdi nah kengngi pe da bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Dede tinggimgwabe pe dage rangdi, “Zechariah, ngngi so, kedanemene n kekie kingneilu da, nah n nau Elizabeth mipeina ge ncu mna beu zie, nah nang pe zi John qu zie.” <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Nah nang n suiyisüt kecu bamlu zie, nah mina kekiee ge pecu mna kelune penui suiyisüt zie. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Kedanemene pa au Rampaube dwade mina kemlang ge zie, nah zau mede zau kengkiengbe pa madaude sak kerabe ma, nah pe pui henabam gade de pecu Kemci Rabe ne kepui teizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kubezau nah zau kengkieng tung kelak gade John Nazaritbe lie la. Cide pekie, mige kemlang sampet kegai gade pelung pelane teu Tinggwang de peudi kecu.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Nah pa Israel napeidung kekiee ge de teunreu pwa Rampaube penui Tinggwang dage kai dai luzie. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Nah pa Elijah rabe nah pe kengkieng gade Rampaube dwa rai gwang zie, mipeimedung lung teinreu pwa penui name dage kailu kerane nah samzai tei kemakme de kenzuime maci gage kailu kerane, ciciu eh minadung de pa Rampaube ziemne mteilwe teleilu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal. 4:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAL 4:6">6</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Pecai Zechariah tinggimgwabe dage rangdi, “Dainzwa Ih aide teigwang zielie kecu ci lulai? Kedanemene Ih au kecingme ge dida, nah a nau de cing dida.” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Nah tinggimgwabe pe sam keli eh pe dage rangdi, “Ih au Gabriel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gabriel: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hezi pekie aide au “Tinggwang gu Kengkieng Mege”, samliakeyi paukelabe.</char></note>, Tinggwang dwa ga sap kelabe, nah acu ndage samliakeyi aide teu gwang rang beulo langgai lie. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Nah ainie, nang n let gah dizie nah ma aidungde tei gwang kemaktane nang marang gailak dizie, kedanemene nang a samdung nlum kemakne, cide peting siakdau teicanglu zie.” <verse eid="LUK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Nah Zechariah de minadung kwabam, nah pa kerecaki ga bam tie kedine penui swagah bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Dede pa mpet keludau, pa penui de resiu lu tadi nah penui pa kerecaki gade marengei ge ngauluda de eh cetlu; nah pa penui de marehidung tei lia bamdi nah maranglu mene bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Nah cinzwa eh pa kerecaki ga cingkuta ketei ting cang dige, pa pe kilung ga gwangdi.<verse eid="LUK 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Nah aipau tingbaziedung de cai, pe nau Elizabeth tetlak di, nah kei mengei ge pa pekatei mbai bamdi, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />pa rang eh, “Aide Rampaube a ziemne teigai da, acu pesui eh piegai kecu tingdau, minadung kakgade a ngam keu gidi kerane.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:23">Ken. 30:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mary Elizabeth da rwakemie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Nah kei herok bekei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kei herok bekei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elizabeth tetlak kelu kei peherok bekei.</char></note>, Tinggwang tinggimgwabe Gabriel de Galilee ga Nazareth lie qukela namdi gage langgai, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />relei kemcipui mipei ge pe zi Joseph lie kecu, David kiriame pei, naurang tei pwa kebam pui dage kai, nah relei kemcipui zi au Mary. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Nah tinggimgwabe peda gwang eh rangdi, “Nsuiyi lulo, Tinggwang suibepoi! Rampaube ncu ngngwa la.” <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Dede pe samdung ziemne pecu kebwakdi nah kelum kegai aide dai pai kenzwa ge bi kecu pa cet bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Nah tinggimgwabe pe dage rangdi, “Ngngi so, Mary, kedanemene Tinggwang ncu ngau pesuilu delu. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Nah pielo, nang tetlak luzie, nah mipeina ge de mna lu zie, nah nang pe zi Jisu qu zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isa. 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Pa au disüt zie nah pecu Hutube Napei lie quzie, nah Rampaube Tinggwang pe pei David hegwangbam de pecu peu zie. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Nah pa Jacob leuhme reu kelungta kedi tei zie, nah pe hegwangram au penli bamlak.” <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Dede Mary tinggimgwabe dage rangdi, “Ih relei kemci pui ge, cine dainzwa aiciu lulai?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Nah sam keli eh, tinggimgwabe pe dage rangdi, “Kemci Rabe n reu ga gwang zie, nah Hutube kengkieng ne ncu sunglu zie. Ciziemne, kemci nabe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kemci nabe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jisu mipui ge dade lunghlu nah cine pa mina kesang teidi. Pe pei au Tinggwang nah pa au Tinggwang Nabe.</char></note> de mna lai eh kebam de de Tinggwang Nabe lie qu zie. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Nah pielo, n kibaume pui Elizabeth, pade mipeina gede tetlakla dida pecing caine, nah aide pe ziemne kei peherok bekei dida, pecule nagahpuige lie qula. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kedanemene Tinggwang teigaikelak magede gahlu.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Ge Mary rangdi, “Pielo, Ih au Rampaube kilabepui. Nang kerang de nzwa a dage peu teigai lu.” Pecai tinggimgwabe pe dade tetdi.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Pecai cipau tingbadung dau Mary cuhlu delwe kideutu nam, Judah namdi gega kelwa miedi, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />nah pa Zechariah kiga lütlu delwe Elizabeth de kelumgai. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Nah Mary kelum kegai Elizabeth siu keludau, ngiena pe za kelade nsündi, nah Elizabeth da Kemci Rabe ne kepui teidi. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Nah pa sahbak gai eh rangdi, “Nang mipuime kakgade samlampungtube pui, nah n za ga kela nade de samlampungtu. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Nah ada aide dainzwa teilu no, ciu eh a Rampaube pui ada gwang kera? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Kedanemene pielo, nang kelum kegai kwa siu herizi, a za ga kela ngiena de pesuiyi eh nsündi da. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Nah Rampaube peda ma rangkedidung de teicanglu kera nlum kelube puide au samlam punglie.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mary lei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Nah Mary ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“A keringria Rampaube de twala,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />nah a rabe acu rikelube Tinggwang gade pesui bamdida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:1">1 Sam. 2:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Kedanemene pa pe kilabepui hena eh kebam puide pie kegaine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Kedanemene pielo, cu gade ceheu leune de acu samlam kepungbe pui lie eh qu zieda,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />kedanemene mapekiene ga Ngkiengtube Tinggwang a dage makedidung tei kegaine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">nah pe zi au mci,<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />nah pe ngaugia au pecu rüt kelame da ceheu ge cai ceheu ge da lazie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 103:17">Lei. 103:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Pa pe bale makedi tei gaida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">penui mlung kecetdung ngang kelame de pa teizang dida.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Pa hegwangmedung de penui hegwangbamdung gade gwagi dida</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">nah kehename de teucuh dida.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Pa kemzeumedung de peu makeyidung le tyei nggei luda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">dede keheime de pa mta eh langgi dida.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Pa pe ngaugia de nsung eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">pe kilabe Israel de nghabeu da,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />pa anui peime dage rang kebeu nzwa, Abraham nah kelungta pe leuhme dage.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mary au Elizabeth de keicum kenzwa ge ngngwa bamlu, nah pecai pe kilung ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Duipumketeibe John de kemna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Nah Elizabeth mna kerating gwangdi, nah pa mipeina ge de mnalu. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Nah pe kidame nah pe kibaume Rampaube pe ngaugia kedi pe dage pwalia kegai ha siu luge, penui pecu ngngwa penui suisütdi.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Ngiena lang hesetne dige, penui henanabe geurum kera gwanglu, nah penui pe zi pe pei zi leu eh Zechariah msiak zie lie bam. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Dede pe pui keli eh rangdi, “Lak. Iciumeliene, pecu John lie quzie.” <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Dede penui pe dage rangdi, “N kibaume kakgade migede aipau zi de msiak pwa kebam gah.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Cidau penui pe pei dage marehidung tei gai, pa pe zi dai nsiak neu bambi keteu eh. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Nah pa kerau kwak kielu delwe raugai, “Pe zi au John.” Nah penui pelane penui swagahdi. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Ge zette pa pe mui ngngalu nah pe mleu nralu, nah pa marang eh, Tinggwang de twa bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Nah penuide twagwa eh kelunghme pelane ngnyidi, nah maha aidungde pelane Judea kideutu nam pekiene ga rang gwangdi. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Nah maha aidung siu kelu leu cidung de penui mlungdung gage kai pwa ladi eh, ranggai, “Hena aipau nade dai ketei nage zieno?” Kedanemene, Rampaube kengkieng pecu ngngwa kesanglu.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zechariah lei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Nah pe pei Zechariah Kemci Rabe le puipung eh cairasam rangdi,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Israelme Tinggwang, Rampaube de peu samlam pungkelube tei lulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">kedanemene pa ri beuzie lie eh gwang nah pe minadung de kelilu da.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Nah pe kilabe David leuhme gade</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">anui ziemne kelikelu kii ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:69 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kii ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kii ge au ngkieng, kemdu, nah kengkieng rehi da.</char></note> teucuhlu da<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />(ndaa pe kemci caihakecime mui gade pa rangkebeu nzwa),<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />anui ngauraume dade</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">nah anuide ngkau kelame pelane ba gade kelilu kerane;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:71 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:10">Lei. 106:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />anui paume de ngaugia liagai kera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">nah pe kemci samkak de nsunglu kerane,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />pa anui pau Abraham dage sampet kegaide,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />anui ngauraume ba gade kelilu eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">ngnyidi mene pe gwa teilu kerane,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />pe dwagade mci nah samsanglu kerane anui tingba zie pelane.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Nah nang, henanabe, ncule pwa Hutube Tinggwang caihakecibe lie qu kesang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">kedanemene nang Rampaube dwa mie pe lampuidung mtei zielu;<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />pe minadung de kelikelu maci de peu kerane</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">penui maudung gikebeu gade,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />anui Tinggwang ngaugia keyide ziemne aide tei luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">kedanemene cide ziemne kecehu gade naimiak pet eh gwang anuide ngha zie,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />kemui ga kebam nah ketsai mie kangga kelame de gi mbaalu kerane; anui pi sau pwa lungciep lampui gage sau gailu kerane.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Nah henanabe lungh cuh nah rabe lamde ngkienglu, nah pa Israelme mtei miakngau tei kemaktane pa hetaideu ga ladi.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Jisu de kemna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Nah cipau tingdau, ainzwa eh teigwang, Caesar Augustus kideu peciakne de hezi rau lulo hezai kaidi. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Aide Quirinius Syria deuceudi tei kebam tingdau hezi kerau raitube. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Nah mileune de hezi rau kera pe nam rip ga gwangdi. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Nah Joseph de Galilee ga, Nazareth namdi gade, Judea deu, David namdi Bethlehem lie qu kela ga hangdi, kedanemene pa au David leuhme nah pe kiria mege kecune. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Pa hezi rau kera Mary de nzanglwe mie, pe naurang teipwa kebambe puide nah pa au nlaigailak ladi. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Nah penai Bethlehem ga kebam dau, pena de mna kera ting gwangdi. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Nah pa pe neraibe mipeina de mnalu, nah pa paidung le pecu kezuilu delwe pecu ketumkwak gage kaizeulu, kedanemene hebeuhki ga penui ziemne heni gah kedine.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meurünkekwame nah Tinggimgwame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Nah cipau cuikui ga meurünkekwame bam, penui au tingmui penui meurünhau de luhdung gade kwala. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Nah Rampaube samgwame ge penuida gwang, nah Rampaube kendude penuide tau twagwadi, nah penui ngngi sütdi. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Nah tinggimgwabe penui dage rangdi, “Ngngi so, kedanemene ainie, Ih nnuida misui yisüt kecu samliakeyi teu gwangla, cide mina leune da gwang zie. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Kedanemene henai nnui ziemne David namdi gage kelikelube de mnalu da, pa au Khrista Rampaube. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Nah aide nnui dage marehi teikelia ge zie: nnui ngiena de paidung le kezuilwe ketumkwak ga zeu bam eh ngaulu zie.” <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Nah zette tinggimgwabe de ngngwa eh tinggim ga kebam maadi ge gwang, Tinggwang de twa eh cu,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Hutu ga kebam Tinggwang de peu hetwa pung kelube tei lulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">nah kideu ga, pa pesui kelame minadung kakga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">lungciepbe bam lulo.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Nah cinzwa eh, tinggimgwame penui dade tetpwa tinggim gwang kedidau, meurün kekwamedung hangge ge dage rangdi, “Kesang anui Bethlehem ga kecang mie go, delwe Rampaube anui dage lia kegai tei kedi ma aidungde pie go.” <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Nah penui zette cika mie nah Mary penai Joseph, nah ngiena ketumkwak ga zeu kebambe de ngaulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Penui pecu ngaukelu cai, hena ainade ha penui dage sam rang kebeude penui mide ranglia. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Nah meurünkekwame penui dage ma kerangdung de siukelu leune penui swagahdi. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Dede Mary au sam aidungde pelane pe mlung gage kaiteu eh mning ladi. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Pecai meurünkekwame, penuide rangkebeu nzwa, penui ngau nah siukelu pelane ziemne Tinggwang de teindu nah twa eh cailigwangdi.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu de kerecaki ga ngngwakegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Nah lang hesetne cang eh pe geurum luge, pe zi Jisu msiaklu, pecu tetlak kemak dwa tinggimgwabe ne pezi msiak kebeu de.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Nah Moses ne hezai kai kebeu nzwa, penuide teikemci tingbadung gwang cang luge, penai pecu Rampaube dage pwa peu kera pecu ngngwa Jerusalem ga hang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:6">Lev. 12:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />(Rampaube zai gage rau teukela nzwa, “Neraibe pei keheibede de Rampaube dwa de kemcibe tei zie”),<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Tet. 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />nah Rampaube zai gage raupwa kela nzwa, “Tamhau kena mede ruipuine kena,” ratak tei kerane. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Lev. 12:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Nah pielo, Jerusalem ga mige pe zi Simeon lie qu kelage bam, nah mina aipaude au renet lam mtingsüt nah masang eh, Israelme de helungtaumla beu kera kwakela kauge nah Kemci Rabe peda la. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Nah Kemci Rabe pa Rampaube Khrista de ngau kemak dwa pa ketsai ngau lak lie peda ge liagai. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Nah Kemci Rabe gade pa kerecaki ga lütlu, nah pe pui penai pe pei henanabe Jisu de hezaibe gade teilo kebeu nzwa tei kera ngngwa lüt luge, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />pa pecu pwalu delwe Tinggwang de twa eh rangdi,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Rampaubo, n sam de nzwa, peu n kilabe de pe lungciep eh tetlu culo.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kedanemene a miakle n kelikelu de ngaulu delu,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />cide nang mina pelane dwagade mtei luda:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:5">Isa. 40:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Gentileme ziemne keuliakegai kebaa ge nah n minadung Israelme ziemne kendu ge.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Nah pe pei penai pe pui pe ha kerang de ziemne penai swagahdi. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Nah Simeon penaide samlambeu, delwe pe pui Mary dage rangdi, “Ainie, hena ainade de Israel ga mina kekiee kaudi kera nah cuhlu kera ziemne kedetlu nah rang kemmau marehi ge ziemne, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Isa. 8:14-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />nah kingtie gele n keringria de reu zie, iciu eh mina kekieege lungcet keulialu kerane.” <verse eid="LUK 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Cika Asher leuhme, Phanuel napui Anna, caihakecipui ge bamla. Pa au cing sütdi, pe relei gade mmi hena ge pe nahpei de ngngwa lungh, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />nah pa au hemipui tei lunghla eh mmi riakheset eh mdai di. Pa madaude kerecaki pütdi lama, tingmui tingba kemmwang nah kekie gade Tinggwang gwatei bamla. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Nah cipauting siakdau pa nghanglwe Tinggwang de twa cuhdi nah Jerusalem de rikelu kwa kebam peciakne dage henanabe ha ranglia bamdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:9">Isa. 52:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Penui Rampaube zai nzwa ma pelane tei cang dige, penui Galilee deu ga, penui namceu Nazareth ga cailligwangdi.<verse eid="LUK 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Nah henanabe Jisu mmi nah ngkieng cuhlu, maci le puipung eh nah Tinggwang ngaugia peda la.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Henanabe Jisu kerecaki ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Cu pe pui pe pei mmi ramsangne Jerusalem ga Kahkegwang Ngyi ga mie muila. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Pa mmi kereiekena dige, penui hengyi zaibe mzui Jerusalem ga hang. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Hengyi tingbadung cang dige, penui kilung cailigwang keladau, henanabe Jisu Jerusalem ga bamdi. Dede pe pui pe pei cide ci ma. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Dede pa penui beuhmaa ga la delie kecu cet eh, penui langnai ge beuh tettei tiege<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:44 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">langnai ge beuh tettei tiege: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">20-30 kilometer </char></note> ga gwangdi. Pecai penai pecu penui kibaume nah zangnamedung kakgade peei cuhdi. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Dede penai pecu ngaulu ta dige, pecu peei eh penai Jerusalem ga cailigwangdi. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Lang cumne cai penai pecu kerecaki ga, keledeumedung kakga bam eh, nah penui kwa kingnei, nah penui dade maketeu bam eh ngaulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Nah pe sam siukelu leune pe maci nah pa samlidung de ziemne penui swagahdi. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Penai pecu ngau luge, penai swagahdi, nah pe pui pe dage rangdi, “Ana, daitei anai dage aiciu gai no? Pielo, n pei anai, anai lung keherei eh ncu peei la lie.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Dede pa penai dage rangdi, “Daitei nnai acu peei lano? Ih a Pei ki ga bam maikesia nnai ci meni?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Dede pa penai dage kerang sam de penai cilu tadi. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Pecai pa penaide ngngwa Nazareth ga nghunglu nah penai sam mzai bamdi. Dede pe pui ma aidung pelane pe mlung gage kai pwa ladi.<verse eid="LUK 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Nah Jisu maci si reureulu nah lungh ngkieng cuhlu, nah Tinggwang nah mina suibe teilu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Duipumketeibe John lampui ketelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Cu Tiberius Caesar kedi tei kelu mmi kereiemengei bekum, Judea cuikui ga Pontius Pilate ne deuceudibe tei, nah Galilee ga Herod ne deuceudibe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hangdeu cuikui mdai gade cuikui ge reu kedibe</char></note> tei, nah pe sinabe Philip ne Ituraea penai Trachon cuikui ga deuceudibe tei nah Lysanias ne Abilene ga deuceudibe tei, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Annas penai Caiaphas ne cingku kedibe ketei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Annas penai Caiaphas ne cingku kedibe ketei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Caiaphas au Annas mede Ananias tsapei, nah cide nzwa penai cingku kedi bam de penlia tei eh teugwang kecu tei.</char></note> ting dau, Zechariah napei, John da Tinggwang sam hetaideu gade gwang. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Cine pa Jordan cuikui lule ailam pelane ga mie eh kemaugilu kera ziemne helungkenreu duipum de ledeu gwang. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Caihakecibe Isaiah samdung kesanglaisiu ga raupwa kebam nzwa eh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Mige hetaideu gade makwa sah eh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Rampaube lampui de mtei lulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Pe lampuidung tei mzui lulo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 40:3</char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Langkam leune tei pui luzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">nah lamlwatu nah kideutu leune tei hena dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">nah lampui kengkoidung de tei mzui dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">nah lampuidung kesia de tei mdui dizie,<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />nah mina pelane Tinggwang kelikelu de ngau zie.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isa. 40:3-5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Cine pe dade duipum tei zie lie kegwang maadibe dage John rangdi, “Nnui neidui namedung! Caune nnuide gwang kezeu lunghop gade pak lulo rangmriak beuno? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Ciziemne, helung nreulu kebui tsidung bui lulo, nah nnuikatei nnui lung gade, ‘Anui au anui pei Abraham bam lie,’ de eh rang cuh so, kedanemene Ih nnui dage rangla Tinggwang au aipau tsudung dele Abraham name teu cuhlu bui. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Iciu liede, mreu de au tsingbangdung mah gage kai dida. Cine tsingbang petsi keyi buila kemak keheibe de bi kaudi eh mi gage kelien gaidi zie.” <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Ge hemaabedung de pe dade keteu bamdi, “Iciucai anui daipai tei zie no?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Nah pa penui sam keli eh rangdi, “Ncwa kena kebambe de kette kegahbe de mzibi maisia, nah ketyeipok kebambe de cinzwa teilu maisia.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Cidau heraha kehamedung de duipum tei zielie gwang, nah penui pe dage rangdi, “Keledeubo, anui daipai teilai?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Nah pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnuide ha lulo de kebeu de swa ha si so.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Cidau reugwamedung de pecu keteu, “Nah anui daipai teilai?” Cine pa penui dage rangdi, “Magede süt eh, mede kenret rang mmau eh keuso, nah nnui ziehi dele mnunglu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Nah minadung au reguisüt eh kwabam nah peciakne de penui lung gade John aipaude Khrista demi mebi de cet bam kapdi. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />John keli eh, penui pelane dage ranggai, “Kesang Ih nnuide duile duipum tei, dede mige aswa de ngkieng gwa cuge gwang zeu, Ih au pe kila tei kera nah pe picum ria hiak kerade dui lie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ih au pe kila tei kera nah pe picum ria hiak kerade dui lie </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mi kedame picum ria hiak kempet au kilabaangme ta ge.</char></note> Pa Kemci Rabe nah mi le nnuide duipum tei zie. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Pe tsingdap au peba gala, pe hecaipung de gui mcigilu kerane, nah wheat pe bau gage hekwalu kerane. Dede pa perie de tei mmüt gai kelak mile ru dizie.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Ciziemne, ma kedadung kekiee de kecung eh, pa samliakeyi de pwa mina de ledeubeu. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Dede John deuceudibe Herod de pe swacingbe nau Herodia ziemne, nah pa ma kesiadung leune tei kedi ziemne kesiugai. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Cidungde pelane reu si eh pa John de hebaangki gage tui gaidi.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu duipum nah pe kiria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Cu ciciu eh mina pelane duipum tei luge, Jisu de de duipum teilu nah pa kekie tei kebam dau, tinggimdung ngkeidi, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />nah Kemci Rabe pumbe rehi gade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pumbe rehi gade: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide mi miakngau tei eh ngau kesang, nah mina ne de ngau da.</char></note> tamhau nzwa pereu ga hung, nah tinggim gade makwa ge, “Nang au a na, akube. Ih ncu a suiyi luda,” de eh gwang.<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Jisu pe zierang ta tei mdeu kecu dau pa mmi camrei kenzwa ge di. Pa au (mina lungcet gade cai) Joseph na, Heli na, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Matthat na, Levi na, Melchi na, Jannai na, Joseph na, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Mattathias na, Amos na, Nahum na, Esli na, Naggai na, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Maath na, Mattathias na, Semein na, Josech na, Joda na, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Joanan na, Rhesa na, Zerubbabel na, Salathiel na, Neri na, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Melchi na, Addi na, Cosam na, Elmadam na, Er na, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Joshua na, Eliezer na, Jorim na, Matthat na, Levi na, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Simeon na, Judah na, Joseph na, Jonam na, Eliakim na, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Melea na, Menna na, Mattatha na, Nathan na, David na, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:14">2 Sam. 5:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Jesse na, Obed na, Boaz na, Salmon na, Nahshon na,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:20-22">Rut. 4:20-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Amminadab na, Admin na, Arni na, Hezron na, Perez na, Judah na,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 2:1-14">1 Hel. 2:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Jacob na, Isaac na, Abraham na, Terah na, Nahor na, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Serug na, Reu na, Peleg na, Eber na, Shelah na, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Cainan na, Arphaxad na, Shem na, Noah na, Lamech na, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Methuselah na, Enoch na, Jared na, Mahalaleel na, Cainan na, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Enos na, Seth na, Adam na, Tinggwang na.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Jisu de kehedei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Pecai Jisu, Kemci Rabe le kepui tei eh, Jordan Reuki gade cailigwangdi, nah Rabe ne pecu renaamkang gage ngngwa gai, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />cikade zie riakdai ge herakesiabe ne pecu kedakdi. Cipau tingdau pa magede tyei ma, nah cidungde cangdi ge pa mzeu di. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Ge herakesiabe pe dage rangdi, “Nang magade Tinggwang Nabe lie cai, aipau tsu de dage sam rang gailo iciude cide tangku kwak mmilu kerane.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Dede Jisu pecu keligai, “Kesanglaisiu ga ainzwa rau teula, ‘Mina tangku rünne le lungh gailak.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Hez. 8:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Pecai herakesiabe pecu ngngwa hangdi nah kideu ga hegwangramdung pelane pecu keulia gai peting kedui nage gage. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Pecai herakesiabe pe dage rangdi, “Ih aipau pelane reu kengkieng nah penui kendu ncu peu zie, kedanemene cidungde acu pwapeu delu, nah Ih cide Ih peu keneume keheibede peu lubui. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Cine, nang a dwa keumie acu reca cai, cidungde pelane n gu dizie.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Dede sam keli eh, Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Kesanglaisiu ga ainzwa rauteula, ‘Nang n Tinggwang Rampaube de reca zie, nah nang pe gwa rünne tei zie.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Hez. 6:13</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 6:14">14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Pecai pa Jisu de Jerusalem ga ngngwa gwang lwe pecu peu kerecaki peureu hutu ga bamlu, delwe pe dage rangdi, “Nang Tinggwang Nabe liecai, aika de cak mie gai pielo. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Kedanemene ainzwa rauteula,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">‘Pa n ziemne tinggimgwame de ajadung kai gai zie, ncu gumlu kerane,’<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />nah, ‘Penui ncu penui badung le pwa cuhlu zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">iciu eh nang tangtsu gage n pi sam melu kerane.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Lei. 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Dede sam keli eh, Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Kesanglaisiu ga ainzwa rangla, ‘Nang n Rampaube Tinggwang de kehedei gage kailak.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Hez. 6:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Herakesiabe mdakkepie leune teicangdi ge, tingkak ke pe dade tetdi.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nazareth gade Jisu de mlaikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Ge Jisu Kemci Rabe kengkieng gade Galilee ga cailigwangdi, nah pe hadung twagwa kebam cuikui pelane ga rangpupbak ladi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Nah penui synagoguedung ga pa mide ledeu cuhdi, mteibena twa pung eh.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Cu pa pecu nkwet cuh kecu nam, Nazareth ga gwanglu, nah pe zai ge nzwa, pa Sabbath benai synagogue ga lütlu, nah pa pei sahbak gai kera cuh saplu. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Ge pecu caihakecibe Isaiah laisiudum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Caihakecibe Isaiah laisiudum: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isaiah cairasam raupwa bam aipau kwakde ga.</char></note> de peu. Pa laisiudum letlu ge ainzwa rauteu kela de ngaulu,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Rampaube Rabe ada la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">kedanemene pa samliakeyi pwa kegahme de ledeu lo acu keniaklu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Pa acu hebaangmedung de suirang paulia kera langgai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">nah miakcitme de peu mangaudailu kera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">nah tei kehereikelame de lungmpet kera,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />nah Rampaube suiyi mmi de sahgailu kerane.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 58:6">Isa. 58:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isa. 61:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Ge pa laisiudum hezuidi eh, hegwa tei kebambe de peu daidi, delwe bamdi. Cu synagogue ga kebam leune pecu pielingci bam kapdi. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Pecai pa penui dage rang cuhdi, “Henai nnui kesiu gade Kesanglaisiu aide tei canglu da.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Nah mina pelane pecu twa kapti, nah pe mui gade ngaugia samdung rang kepet ziemne penui swagahdi, nah penui rangdi, “Aide Joseph napei meni?” <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Ge pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui mi rangla samgwa aide a dage rangbi zie, ‘Daru kecibo, n katei ncu tei mmi lulo. Capernaum gade tei kecu anui kesiudung de n ram gade de cide kesiakge teigai lo.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Dede pa rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, caihakecime mige de de pekatei pe ram gade au yilie lula ma. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Dede kesangsiakpe gade Ih nnui dage rangzeu, ndaa Elijah kelung tingdau Israel ga hemipui kekiee ge bamla, cidau mmi kecum eh kei herok ting ge ngkuidi, cidau hangdeu pelane reu ga herakum kumgwangdi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Heg. 17:1, 18:1</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Dede Elijah de penui mige dage de langgai ma, Sidon cuikui ga kelung hemipui Zarephath dage gwale.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:9">1 Heg. 17:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Nah caihakecibe Elisha tingdau Israel ga kempame kekiee la, dede penui migede de teimci beuma, dede Syriame pei Naaman de gwale.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Heg. 5:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Ge penui sam aidungde siu luge synagogue ga kebam pelanene penui rata sütdi. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Cine penui cuhlu, delwe pecu namceu gwale teu mpetdi, nah penui renam teipwa kebam kideutu reu hetiatu gage pecu ngngwa nghang di, iciu eh pecu cikade kelui gaidi kerane. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Dede pa minadung kakgade zau eh, pa pe lampui le gwangdi.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ne herakesiabe de gwampet kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Pecai pa Capernaum namdi ga nghungdi, Galilee deuzi ga, nah pa Sabbath benai penuide ledeu cuhdi. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Nah penui pe keledeu sam ziemne penui swagahdi, kedanemene pe sam ga au kengkieng bam kecune. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Cu synagogue ga mipei ge mcikemak rabe peda kela kauge bam, nah pa sahbak eh hap eh ranggai, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Ha! Nazareth Jisu nang anui de teu daipai teilai? Nang anuide ngkapdi zielie gwang lani? Nang caubi Ih cibam, Tinggwang Kemcibe lie!” <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Nah Jisu pecu kesiu eh ranggai, “Zing dedi, nah pe dade mpetdi!” Iciu ge herakesiabe minabe de keling mie minadung kakgage kaidi, delwe pecu teikeherei mezing eh, pa pe dade mpetdi. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Cine penui pelane penui swagahdi, nah ket ket dage rang eh, ranggai, “Aide dai sam no, pa aja nah kengkieng teu eh mcikemak rabedung de lang mpet nah penui mpetdi zeu kecu?” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Cine cuikui twagwapung kebam pelane ga pe ha rang gwangdi.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu mina kekiee ge de teikengkei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Pecai pa cuhlwe synagogue gade tet di, nah pa Simon ki ga lütlu. Simon nai mra eh mateei süt bam, cine pe ziemne pe dade penui nggia kiedi. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Cine pa pe taiga saplwe kemra de kesiugai ge cide pecu pütdi, iciu ge pa zette cuhlwe penui gwatei cuhdi.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Cu tingnaimiak nlwetdi lai kezeu dau, keheibe de mra eh mateei ketsamtsam kebam leunedung de peda penuide ngngwa gwang beu, nah pa cidung ket ket reu gage pe ba hwagai, delwe penuide tei ngkeibeu bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Nah herakesiabedung de penui kekiee ge dade mpetlu nah sahbak eh ranggai, “Nang au Tinggwang Nabe da!” Dede pa penuide kesiudi delwe peu penuide marang tadi, kedanemene penui pa Khrista kecu ci kedine.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Tingbalu ge, pa tetpwa heni mi kegah ga miedi, dede mina maabe pecu pei ladi nah peda gwanglu, nah pecu penui dade tetdi helo kaam kera teidi. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Dede pa penui dage rangdi, “Ih Tinggwang hegwangram samliakeyi teu namdi kedadung gade ledeu maisia, kedanemene aipau kiede ziemne acu langgailu.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Pecai pa Judea deuceu ga synagoguedung ga ledeu jüja ladi.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Ledeukelu raitume de qukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Nah ciciu eh, mina maadibe Jisu de nia lüt nah Tinggwang sam ngking kebam dau, nah pa Gennesaret rejaai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gennesaret rejaai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaude zi keda ge cai Galilee jaaidi, nah Tiberias jaaidi de de qula.</char></note> kungga sap kebam dau. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Pa rejaai kungga liem kena kebam ngau, dede heka ketuimedung cikade mpetlu delwe penui helangdung hui bam. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Pecai pa liem ket paube ga nlütlu, cide au Simon liem, nah pa pecu cide hangdeu gade manage kemdei gega ge tau lüt gai lo kie di. Pecai pa bamlu delwe liem gade maadibe de ledeu. <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Cu pa marang cangdi ge, pa Simon dage rangdi, “Dui cukgwacu gage liem taugai delwe nnui helangdung sam gailo samlu kerane.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev 4:4-32</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Dede Simon keligai eh rangdi, “Kedibo, anui tingmui tuicang da, dede magede tuilu ma, dede n sam ziemne Ih helang samgai zie.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Penui samgai ge, penui heka kekiee ge samlu, nah penui langdung hak dizeu. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Cine penui penui zangme liem keda ga keladungde gwang nghalo bagoi gai nah penui gwanglu eh liem kenana teipui lu, iciu eh penui duiga mlim miedi laidi. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Dede Simon Peter cide ngau luge, Jisu pi ga keumie lu eh ranggai, “Rampaubo, ada de tetdilu, kedanemene Ih au kemau pei ge lu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Kedanemene penui heka kekiee tuikelune pade nah pecu ngngwa kela leune, penui swagahdi, <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />nah cinzwa eh Simon zangbe kena Zebedee napei kena James penai John de penai swagahdi. Cidau Jisu Simon dage rangdi, “Ngngi so; cu gade nang mina de tuidi zie da.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Penui penui liem kideu ga teu mpetlu ge, penui ma pelane gidi delwe Jisu cai suidi.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kempame ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Pecai pa namdi ge ga bamge mpa süt kecume ge peda gwang. Pa Jisu de ngau luge pezu ngkum punglu, delwe pe dade pe nggia kie eh ranggai, “Rampaubo, nang nlungning liecai, nang acu teimci lubui lie.” <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Ge pa pe ba nzang pet pecu deu gai eh, ranggai, “A lungning da. Mci lu.” Nah zette kempa peda de gahdi. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Pecai pa midage de rang helo pecu rangbeu, dede, “Mie eh nkatei ncu cingkupei de lialo delwe ncu teimci kelu ratak tei lulo, Moses ne aja kai kebeu rehi gade, penui dage zierang ge ziemne,” debeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:2-32">Lev. 14:2-32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Dede pe ha rang zang mtei kidi, nah mina hemaa disüt kecu pe keledeu sam kingnei zielie nah penui mateeidung teingkei zielie gwang ngkwalu. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Dede pa nreu mide kegah nidung ga gwang eh kekie teibam dila.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kemnoime gede teikengkei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Pecai cipau tingdau langnaige pa ledeu kebam dau, cika Phariseeme nah hezai keledeume bam, penui Galilee nah Judea namdidung nah Jerusalem gade gwang, nah mide tei ngkeilu kera Rampaube kengkieng pereu gala. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Nah cika midung ge kemnoime gede zeu gage pwa gwang, nah penui pecu pwalüt Jisu dwa gage kaibeu kera peei bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Penui mina maabe ziemne pecu pwa lüt kera lampui peeilu tadi ge, penui kireu rahanglu nah tei tiplu eh pecu pe zeu gage kaipwa minadung kakga, Jisu dwa gage kai. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Penui kenlum ngau eh, pa rangdi, “Minabo, n maudung gibeu di delie.” <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Ge Phariseeme nah laisiukecime rang renia cuh eh, ranggai, “Rang kemsia kerang aide cauno? Tinggwang gwale cauge kemaugilu buino?” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Dede Jisu penui lungcetdung de ci eh, sam keli nah penui dage rangdi, “Nnui daitei eh nnui mlung gade rang renia bam no? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Daide be rang relui no, ‘N maudung gibeu dida’ de kecube mi ‘Cuhlu delwe tet lu’ de kecube no? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Dede nnuide peu Mina Nabe kideu reuga kemaudung gilukebui pe kengkieng kebam cilu kerane lie,”, pa kemnoibe dage rangdi, “Ih n dage rangla, cuhlu, n zeu pwalu, delwe n kilung gwang cu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Cine pa zette penui dwagade cuhlu, pa zeu kebam de pwalu nah Tinggwang de twa eh pe kilung gwangdi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Ge penui pelane penui swagahdi, nah penui Tinggwang de twadi, nah kengngi le puipung eh, ranggai, “Anui henai nreikei keteidung ge ngau da.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Levi de qukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Cu ma aidungde cai, pa hegwale tet mpet ge heraha kehame ge pezi Levi heraha keha paiki ga bam eh ngaulu, nah pa pe dage rangdi, “A caisuilu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Cine pa maleune pütdi eh, nah pa cuhlu delwe pecai sui cuhdi.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Pecai Levi taktyei kedige pe ki gage pe ziemne mteilu, nah cika heraha kehame hemaa kedi ge nah kedamedung de si eh penuide ngngwa tyei kera ntum bam. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Dede Phariseeme nah penui laisiukecime pe caisuime dage ncam eh ranggai, “Daitei eh nnui heraha kehame nah kemaumedung de ngngwa matyei lano?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Ge Jisu sam keli nah penui dage rangdi, “Mina yi kebamme daru kecime de teu keratau gah, dede teei kebamme ziemne. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Ih makesangme de qu kerane gwang melie, dede kemaume de helung nreulu lo qu kerane gwanglie.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu dade kemwang ha keteu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Pecai penui pe dage rangdi, “John caisuime mmwang nah kekie teila, nah Phariseeme caisuimedung de cinzwa la. Dede n caisuimedung au tyei nah sak la kela delie.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Ge Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Nnui peu hemeu kehenuime de lakciube pei penuide ngngwa kebam dau mmwang bamdi lubui ni? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Dede peting ge gwang zie, lakciube de penui dade ngngwa tetdi kera. Cidau, cipau tingdau penui mmwang zie.” <verse eid="LUK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Pecai pa samgwa ge de penui dage ranglia. “Migede, pai keheci ge gade hietlwe, cide pai kehegwa gage kopgai lama. Dede pa magade cide tei cai, pai keheci cide hak dizie, nah kehecibe gade hiet kelude de kehegwabe de zeulak. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Nah migede zau keheci pwa zaula kehegwa gage kaila ma. Dede pa cinzwa tei cai, zau keheci dene teigeula de pungpang dizie, nah cide tangra dizie, nah teigeula de teimsia dizie. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Dede zauci pwa teigeula keheci gage kaigai maisia. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Migede, zau kehegwabe sak kelu cai, kehecibe sak neu lama, kedanemene pa ‘Kehegwabe yiki’ de rang lalu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Sabbath Rampaube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Pecai Sabbath benai pa hereiluhdung ga kahgwang kezeu dau, pe caisuimedung herei buidung nrieplu eh cidung de penui ba gage neu ngkak lwe tyeila.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Hez. 23:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Dede Phariseemedung kangge rangdi, “Daitei eh nnui Sabbath benai hezai kemakpe tei lano?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Hez. 23:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Nah penui sam keli eh, Jisu rangdi, “David pa mzeu dige, pa nah pecu ngngwa kelamedung daipai teibi nnui Kesanglaisiu gade pei meni? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Pa Tinggwang ki ga lütlu, nah tangku kemcibe de keulwe tyeilu, nah pecu ngngwa kelame de de peu, cide tyei kera hezai ma, cingkumedung ziemne gwale.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:5-9">Lev. 24:5-9</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 21:6">1 Sam. 21:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Cidau pa penui dage rangdi, “Mina Nabe au sabbath nai reu Rampaube.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Sabbath tingba kedabe naige pa synagogue ga lütlu eh mide ledeu bam ge, cika mipei pe ba zetle tsai kedi ge bam. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Dede laisiukecime nah Phariseemedung pa sabbath nai mide teihemi ziemi lakbi pecu pie ling bam, iciu eh penui pecu mmau kera kie peilu kera ziemne. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Dede pa penui dai cet bambi kecu cilu eh pe ba ketsaibe dage rangdi, “Cuhlu, delwe anui kakga saplu lo.” Cine minabe cuhlu delwe cika saplu. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Pecai Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Ih nnui dade keteu la, sabbath benai keyi tei kera mi kesia tei kera hezai no, keringria kelilu kerabe mi ngkapdi kerabe no?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Ge pa penui peciakne de pie twagwa gai eh pe dage rangdi, “N ba nzang pet gailo.” Nah pa iciu gaige pe ba yi dailu. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Dede penui au penui rata sütdi nah Jisu de daipai tei ziebi kecu penui hangge ge dage rang bamdi.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Langkegaime kereiekena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Pecai cipau tingdau pa kekie tei kera lamlwatu ga hangdi, nah pa tingmui zie pelane Tinggwang dade kie bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Cu tingbalu ge, pa pe caisuimedung de pe dage qu gailu, nah pa cidung kakde kereiekena de kedetlu, cidung de de pa langkegaimedung de qulu: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simon (Pa pecu Peter de de msiak kebeube) nah pe caihereibe Andrew; nah James penai John; nah Philip nah Bartholomew; <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />nah Matthew, nah Thomas; nah Alphaeus napei James; nah Zealot lie qu kelabe Simon; <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />nah James napei Judas; nah Judas Iscariot, mide tui kegaibe tei kedibe de.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samlamdung nah kehereidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Pecai pa penuide ngngwalu delwe lamlwatu gade nghunglu, nah kideu langkie ga saplu, pe caisuime maadi ge, nah mina maadi Judea deuceu leune gade nah Jerusalem nah jaaidikung ga kebam Tyre nah Sidon namdi gade gwang kebamme kakga. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Penui pe sam kingnei zielie nah penui mateei tei hemilu zielie gwanglu. Mcikemak rabedung ne keliang teu kelamedung de de tei hemilu. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Cu hemaabe pelane pecu deugai kera tei ladi, kedanemene kengkieng pe dade mpet eh penui pelane de teingkeilu kebamne.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Pecai pa ngangcuh pe caisuimedung de pie eh rangdi, “Kegahme au samlam pungtu lie, kedanemene Tinggwang hegwangram au nnui gulu. <verse eid="LUK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Cu mzeu kelame samlam pungtu, kedanemene nnui nggeilu zielu. Cu hap kelame samlam pungtu, kedanemene nnui nui zielu. <verse eid="LUK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Mina Nabe ziemne mina nnuide ngkau, nah nnuide keu ntsam nah rang msia, nah nnui zi de sialie mlai cai nnui samlam pungtu lie. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Cipaube nai nnui suiyilu, nah nnui suiyi eh nsaulu, kedanemene pielo, tinggim ga nnui ziehi au disüt lu. Kedanemene penui paumedung de caihakecime de iciu eh gwang delu. <verse eid="LUK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Dede ainie, nnui keheime au, nnui nnui kerelui ngau luda. <verse eid="LUK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ainie, nnui cu nggei kebamme, nnui mzeu dizie. Ainie, nnui cu nui kebamme, nnui suisia nah hap zie. <verse eid="LUK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Ainie nnui, mina pelane nnuide rang hemi kecu dau, kedanemene penui paumedung de kenret caihakecime de iciu gwang da.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngauraume de keku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Dede Ih nnui kingnei kebamme dage rangzeu, nnui ngauraume de kulu nah nnuide ngkau kelame dage ma keyi teigai lu. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Nnuide reset kelame de samlam beulu nah nnuide rangkemsiame ziemne kielu. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />N bia ket lam kepeu kecubede, pecu kedale de nreu beulo, nah mige n pai keu teu kedibe dade, ncwa de peulak lie helo. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Mina keheibe de n dade kie kelame de peulo, nah mi n gudung keu teudi kelame dade, cide kie caili so. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Nah nang peu mina de ndage tei gai keneube, penui dage cinzwa tei gailu. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Kedanemene nang ncu kukelame de rünne kula cai, n keyi daipai no? Kedanemene kemaume de penuide kukelame de ku lalu. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Kedanemene kesang magade nang n dage keyi teigai kelame dage rünne keyi tei gaila cai, n ziemne cide dai gie ge no? Kemaume de cinzwa tei lalu. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Nah magade nang penui dade ngaudailu kera kenlumme de rangkang releubeu lacai, nziemne cide dai gie ge no? Kemaume ne kemaume de releu beula, cide nzwa ngaudailu kerane. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Dede nnui ngauraume de kulu, nah ma keyi penui dage tei gailu, nah magede ngau dailu kera cet mene releu beulu, iciulu cai nnui ziehi disüt zie, nah nnuide Hutube name tei luzie, kedanemene pa au mide twa neula kemakme nah kesiame dade de pe zaiyi lalu. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Nnui Pei Tinggwang mide ngaunggia kecu nzwa eh, nnuide mide ngaunggia lulo.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mimau kepeei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Nah mimau peei so, iciude n mau de peeilak. Mide mmau so, iciude ncu de n mau lak. Mimau gibeu lu, iciude n mau de gibeu zie. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Peulo, iciude ncu de peu zie: mdet kehemi, nimkemtip, hecung kehekwa, nah pui kenlim, cidung de n pi gage ruigai beu zie. Kedanemene nang mdet kebeu dene, ncu de mdet caili daibeu zielu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Pecai pa samgwa ge de penui dage rang si. “Miakcitme ge ne miakcitme ge lampui saulu buini? Penai hangna na hekwaki ga cakmiedi lakni? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Ledeukelume au pe keledeube swa dima, dede mileune de, pecu ledeu cangkebeu caine, pe keledeube nzwa dizie. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Nah nang daitei n sinabe miak ga tsingtwak keceuna de piee lano, dede nkatei n miak ga tsinglwa kebam de ncetla meno? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Nang dainzwa n sinabe dage, ‘Sinabo, n miak ga tsingtwak keceuna de peu acu keu mpet lo,’ de eh ranglu lai, nangbe nkatei n miak ga tsinglwa kebam de pie mene? Nang hezai teikelabo! N miak gade tsinglwa de keu mpet raidi lu, iciude nang n sinabe miak ga tsing twak keceuna de keu mpet kera ngau mcigi luzie.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsingbang ge nah pe tsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Kedanemene tsingbang keyibe petsi kesia buila ma, mede tsingbang kesiabe petsi keyi buila ma. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Kedanemene tsingbang ge de au petsi gade cilula kelane. Kedanemene mina hetubang gade tangzüttsidung railu lama, mede müntiakbang gade kubetsidung railu lama. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Mina keyime pelung mabam keyi gade dai yibi keu mpet la, nah mina kesiame de pe kesia gade dai siabi keu mpet la. Kedanemene pe lung ga kebam gade pe mui rangpet kelane.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiketei kemriak nah kemiebe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Cu nnui daitei eh Ih rang kebeube tei mene acu, ‘Rampaubo, Rampaubo,’ de qula no?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:6">Mal. 1:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Mina keheibe de ada gwang eh a samdung kingnei nah cidungde mzai kelabe, pa daipai nzwa bi Ih nnui dage keulia zie. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Pa au mige kige tei kebam nzwa, pa su hung ncoklu delwe tsura reu gage pe bangdwa dwakelu nzwada. Pecai duinaai gwang nah dui dicuh eh lwamie ki de sam, dede cide teukelai gailak di, kedanemene cide tei ntipsüt kelune. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Dede kingnei lude tei mzaila kemakbe au, mige pebang dwa mene kideu reu gage ki tei kelube nzwa delie, cide de duidi cuh eh dui lwamie sam ge zette cide kaudi, nah ki cide pekap au dizu lie.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Haireu kedibe kenlum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Pecai Jisu minadung kingnei kebam gade pe samdung pelane rangcang dige, pa Capernaum namdi ga nlütdi.<verse eid="LUK 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Cu haireu kedibe kilabe ge, pecu herüt peu süt kecu kauge, mateei eh, tsaidi lai eh bam. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Nah haireu kedibe Jisu ha siulu ge, pa pe dage Jewme hangkiamedung de langgai eh, pecu gwanglo keteu ciu eh pe kilabe de teingkei beulo di. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Nah penui Jisu da gwanglu ge, penui nggia kie eh ranggai, “Pa au nang pe ziemne tei gailu kebuime ge, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />kedanemene pa anui leuhme de ku, nah pa anui ziemne synagogue de teibeulu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Ge Jisu penuide ngngwalwe tetgwang. Dede pa peki gade mdei kemak ga gwangla ge, haireu kedibe pe zangme de langpwa pe dage ranggai, “Rampaubo, nkatei ncu tei keherei la helo, kedanemene Ih au ncu peu gwang a kikang lütlu kebuime melu. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Aide ziemne Ih akatei de teilu kebui nda gwang kera de cet meda, dede sambe ranggai beulo iciude a kilabe yi luzie. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kedanemene Ih de hezai kang ga kebamme ge, reugwame a kang gade bam, nah Ih hangge dage rang eh, ‘Tetdi,’ dege pa tet dila; nah kedage dage, ‘Gwang,’ dege pa gwangla; nah a kilabe de, ‘Aide teigai,’ dege pa cide teila.” <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Cu Jisu aide siulu ge, pe ziemne pa peswa gadi, nah nreu gwang mina pecaisui kela hemaabe dage, pa rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rang liazie, Ih Israelme kak gade de kenlum ci kenzwa Ih ngau ma.” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Mina langkegaimedung kilung nligwanglu ge, kila peide yibam eh penui ngaulu.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu hemipui ge na de teucuh kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Iciu eh gwang pecai benai pa Nain<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nain: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Namdi aide Galilee ga bam, Mount Tabor tingbangle de mile kena kenzwa ge, nah Capernaum gade dei ma.</char></note> lie kecu namdi ga gwang. Nah pa ledeukelumedung nah mina maadi ge pecu ngngwalwe miedi. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Pa namdibe rieki nnagwang kezeu dau, nah ainie, ketsaime mige de pwa mpetla, pa pepui na pumlibe (nah pa hemipui ge) nah namdi gade mina maadi ge pecu ngngwala. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Cu Rampaube pecu ngaulu ge, pa pecu ngau nggia sütdi nah pe dage rangdi, “Hap so.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Pecai pa gwang eh paaupwarak deugai ge pwa kelamedung nlai mene sap bamdi. Iciu eh pa rangdi, “Rehangbo, Ih n dage rangla, cuhlu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Cine ketsaibe cuh bamlu delwe marang bamdi, nah pa pecu pwa pe puide peudi. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Pecai mina pelane ngngidi, nah penui Tinggwang de twa eh ranggai, “Caihakecibe kedige anui kakga cuhbam dida” nah “Tinggwang gwang pe minadungde pie gaida.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Nah pe ha aide Judea deu pelane ga nah twagwapung kebam cuikui leune ga rang gwangdi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nah Duipumketeibe John</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Pecai John ne ledeukelume ma aidung pelane ziemne pe dage ranglia. Cine John pane ledeukelume hangna de qulu, delwe <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />penaide langpwa Rampaube dage kai eh cu, “Nang gwang zielie kelabe deni, mi anui mi kedage de piebam zie reuno?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Cu penai Jisu da gwang luge, penai rangdi, “Duipumketeibe John anaide langgai nda rang kera, ‘Nang gwang zielie kelabe deni, mi anui mi kedage de pie bamzie reuno?’” <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Cipau bamdakkak gade pa mateei keherei kelamedung mateei kecuk, nah herakesiabe ne tei keherei kela kekiee de tei ngkeibeu, nah pa miakcitme kekiee de peu mangaulu. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Iciu eh pa penui dage samkeli eh rangdi, “Nnai tetgwang kelucai John dage nnai ngau nah siu keludung rang beulo: miakcitme de mangau luzeu, pepi ketelwame de tetlu dizeu, kempame de de teimci luda, kwenpangme de ma siu luzeu, ketsaimede de kwakcuh luzeu, kegame de samliakeyibe rangpwa penuide ledeubam dida, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Isa. 35:5-6</ref>;<ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />nah acu mmau kemakpe au samlam pungtu delie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Isa. 35:5-6</ref>;<ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />John samgwamedung tet kedicai, pa hemaabe dage John ha ranglia eh, “Nnui hetaideu ga daipai pie zielie pet no? Tingkai ne gui nlai kebam hekuu bang ni? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Dede nnui daipai pie zielie petno? Mina paini kenciep kaikela deni? Ainie, maniadung pemi kehungbe teu kecu nah kehega eh lungh kelame au hegwangkidung ga bamlie. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Dede nnui daipai pie zielie petno? Caihakecime ge ni? Yeo, Ih nnui dage rang liazie, nah caihakecime ge swade direu. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Cipaude au pe ha ainzwa raupwa kelade da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">‘Ainie, Ih au a samgwabe de ndwa langgai zeu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">Cipaude ndwa n lampui telei zie.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal. 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa. 40:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Ih nnui dage rang liazie, mipui dade lung kegwangdung kakgade, migede John swadi dima, dede Tinggwang hegwangram gade au ceutu nabe de peswa diki.” <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />(Cu mina peciakne nah heraha kehame de si eh, John duipumketeibe ba gade duipum tei kelume sam aide siulu eh Tinggwang au masang lie eh twadi. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Dede Phariseemedung nah Jewish hezaikecimedung au John de peu penuide duipum tei mene Tinggwang lungningbe mlaidi.) <verse eid="LUK 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />“Iciucai, Ih mina aipau ceheu dede daipai le keukeda gai zieno, nah penui daipai nzwano? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Penui au hename nzwa litakni ga kebamme, bamlwe hangge ge de qu eh ranggai, ‘Anui terwaine nnui ziemne kwagai, dede nnui limlu meda. Anui tsaibai lei teigai, dede nnui haplu meda.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Kedanemene duipumketeibe John tangku tyeima nah zau sak mene gwang, ge nnui rang eh, ‘Pa herakesiabe de ngngwala,’ dedi. <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mina Nabe matyei masak eh gwang, nah nnui rang, ‘Ainie, tyei keneu kauge nah zausak kauge, heraha kehame nah kemaube zangbe!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Dede Tinggwang maci macet au pe name pelane kesanglie dida.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kemau pui ge ne Jisu de keheniak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Cu Phariseeme hangge Jisu de ngngwa matyei zielie qu. Cine Phariseebe kiga nlütlwe, pa taktyeibam ga ngngei bam. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Cika namdi ga mipui kemau ketei puige bam. Phariseeme ki gade pa taktyeibam ga ngngei kebam ci luge, pemi kewhung maca kehengui bung ge teugwang, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />nah pecaile pepi taiga sap eh hapbam, iciu eh pa pe miakduile pepi teihwadi, nah pa pe peutamle pwa neucangdi eh pepi kemamgai delwe maca le pwa cide keniaklu. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Cu Phariseeme Jisu de qu kegaibe aide ngau luge, pelung gade rang eh, “Magade aipau peide caihakecime ge lie cai, pa pecu deu kebambe puide cau nah daikenzwa puige bi ci luzie nage, pa au kemaume ge lie kecu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Cine Jisu pe samkeli nah pe dage rangdi, “Simon, Ih n dage mage rang kera bamlie.” Pa rangdi, “Ranggailo, keledeubo!” <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />“Rangkang mide releubeu kelame ge mi hangna pepau pungla. Mige denarii hai mengei nah mige be riakngei pungla.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">denarii ge tingnai ge makam tei kelu zie nzwada. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Penai pecu peu gailak dige, pa penai hangna nade nggah beudi. Ciziemne, penai caube pecu pesui yiki zieno?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simon pe sam keli eh rangdi, “Ih cet kecu pecu kemaugi kiee kebeube zie.” Ge pa pe dage rangdi, “Nang rangdau da.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Iciu eh pa mipui lam nreugwanglwe Simon dage rangdi, “Nang mipui aide de ngaubam. Ih n kilung lütlu. Nang a pi hui kera dui peu ma, dede pa au pe miakduile a pi teihwa lwe cide pe tamle neucang dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:4">Ken. 18:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Nang au acu kemam ma, dede Ih gwang kelu gade pa a pi kemam kecu mtak ma. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Nang maca pwa a peu keniak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maca pwa a peu keniak: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maca pwa mipeu gage mniak kecu zai Jewme kakde tei bamla.</char></note> ma, dede pa maca kehengui pwa a pi keniak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:5">Lei. 23:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Ciziemne Ih n dage rangla, pe maudung, kiee süt kecu, gibeu dida, kedanemene pa acu kusüt kecune. Dede gi ncam pwa pecu kepeube, ku cam.” <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Pecai pa pe dage rangdi, “N maudung gibeu dida.” <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Dede mi pecu ngngwa ketaktyei kebamme penuikatei penui kak gade rang eh cuh, “Aide cau no, mimau de gibeu kelu?” dedi. <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Ge Jisu mipuibe dage rangdi, “N kenlumle ncu kelilu da. Lungciep gade tetlu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Hetaketabe samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Jisu zette namdidung nah renamdung ga mbeu kegai mide ledeu nah Tinggwang hegwangram samliakeyi zierang tei ladi, nah caisuime kereiekena bau pecu nzangla, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />nah mipui ge dade herakesiabe gwa kedi nah pe mateei teingkei kebeudung gede: Mary, Magdalene lie qu kela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mary, Magdalene lie qu kela: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Magdula” gade qu kelu, pa lung bam kela heni. Galilee Jaaidi ga bam cide, Capernaum tingbang le bie.</char></note> pui, pe dade herakesiabe hena mpetdi; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />nah hegwanpei Herod kerengeibe, Chuza nau Joanna, nah Susanna; nah penui katei penui mabamle penui gwatei kela mina kekieege desi.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Cu maadi ge namceu ketsamtsam gade gwang ngkwalu ge, pa samgwa ge teu rang eh cu: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Heleuh kegime ge peleu gi zielie miedi, nah pa gigai ge, kesa lampuikung ga cakmie, nah cide pidau teidi, nah tingkam ruinedung ne cide patyeilu. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Nah heleuh keda tsura reuga cak miedi, nah cide lungcu luge, cide kidi, kedanemene cide pe kehwa kegane. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Nah heleuh keda cak hetupui kakga lütdi, nah cide lungh cu ge, hetu ne zin cetdi. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Dede heleuh keda tangnia keyi ga cakmie, delwe cide lungcuhlu, cide tsi hai swa kie eh builu”. Pa aidungde rangcangdi cai sahbak eh, “Kingnei kera pekwen kebamme de peu kingnei lulo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Pecai pane ledeukelumedung, “Samgwa aide pekie daipai no?” peda de keteudi. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Nah pa rangdi, “Nnuide au Tinggwang hegwangram kebaih teu keladung de cilu kera peu dida, dede kedamedung dage au Ih samgwadung gade rang, ciu de, ‘ngau bamde, penui ngaulu ma, nah siu bamde penui cilu tadi’ kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa. 6:9-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Cu samgwa de au ai nzwa: heleuh be au Tinggwang samda. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Lampui kungga kebamdung de siu kelumedung, dede herakesiabe gwang eh penui mlung gade sambe keuteu di, ciciu eh penui nlum nah kelilu melu kerane. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Tsura reu ga kebamdung de au, penui siu kelu dau, penui suiyi eh sambe luu kelume da. Dede penui au pe mah gah; penui kak nage nlumlu, nah kehedei gwang ge penui kaudi la. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Hetupuidung kakga cak mie kecudung de cai, penui siu kelumedung da, dede penui lung pet si ge, aipau kideu teilung zaidung nah mahei nah pumtei hengindung ne zim kedime da, nah penui tsicak builu lama. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Dede tangdei keyi ga lüt kelumedung cai, penui sambe siulwe cide teu masang nah helungkeyi gage kaiteu eh, helung ketie teu bam eh petsi bui kelume da.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mitaubung ge nah pebam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Migede mibung mtau lwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mibung mtau lwe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jisu mina de ranglia kera cetlu; agu samgwadung de ma kesangbe teu hebai di kera ne teigai ma, dede keulia mcibeu kerane.</char></note> li gele pwa gumdi lama mede cide zeu kang gage kai lama. Meliene, pa mitaubam gage kaila iciu de mi tet kelütme de kebaabe ngaulu kerane. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Kedanemene magede kebaih teu kela peu cilak lie kecube, mede kengkim peu cilak lie kecube nah hegwale kebaa ga teumpet lak lie kecu bamma. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Cine nnui dainzwa kingnei zeubi, cet siakte lulo, kedanemene kebambe de peukie kisi zie, dede bam kemakme, pe kecet gade bam ha kebam nade de pe dade keuteu si dai dizie.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu pui nah sinamedung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Cipaucai pe pui nah sinamedung peda gwang, dede hemaabe ziemne penui peda gwang nna luma. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Ge mi pe dage rangbeu, “N pui nah n sinamedung hegwale sapbam ncu ngauneu eh peei lalie.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Dede pa sam keli nah penui dage rangdi, “Caugame Tinggwang sam kingnei lu eh cide tei mzai labi, cipaume a pui nah a sinamedung delie.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Cu cipau tingdau langnaige, pa kesang ledeukelumedung de liemge ga ngngwa nlütlu, delwe pa penui dade rangdi, “Anui rejaai lule gim kah mpet lugo.” Cine penui tet gaidi. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Dede penui liem tet lage pa zipdi. Nah rejaai ga tingkai gui sütdi, ciu eh penui liem de duile puidi, nah penui kengngi ga ladi. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Ge penui peda gwanglwe pecu ngkia eh cu, “Keledeubo! Keledeubo! Anui kapdi lauda!” Dede pa mrak lwe, tingkai nah dui mswak de kesiu, ge penui mtakdi, nah cika zing dedi. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Ge pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui kenlum daiga bam no?” Ge penui ngngi nah penui swaga eh hangge ge de ranggai, “Tingkai nah dui dage de sam ranggai ge pe sam mzai kecu aide ai cauno?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu herakesia ne ngngwa kela gede teihemmi kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Cine penui Gerasenes cuikui ga gwanglu, cide Galilee rejaai de kencwa ga bam. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Pa kideu reuga tet mpet ge namdi gade mi herakesiabe ngngwa kelame ge, pecu redaulu. Nah peting ketieege pa pai heni teumah, nah pa kilung gade lung mene, heraudung ga ladi. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Pa Jisu de ngaulu ge, pa hapsüt eh, pe dwaga keumie, nah pa sahbak eh rangdi, “Nang acu teu daipai tei kera bam no Jisu Tinggwang Hutube napei? Ih n dade kiela, nang acu tei keherei helo.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Kedanemene Jisu mcikemak rabe de mpet dilo aja kaibeu. Peting kekiee ge cide ne pecu keliang la, nah pecu mine kwa nah hegeuria le pecu kang nah pikangle kang, nah pecu hegeuriadung cidungde pungcak lwe herakesiabe ne pecu gwa renaamkang gage kaidi zie. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Pecai Jisu pecu keteudi, “N zi cauno?” Nah pa rangdi, “Legion,” kedanemene herakesiabe kekiee peda nlüt kedine. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Nah pe dade penui nggia kie bamdi, aja kaipwa penuide penli kegah kecuk gage kaidi helo eh. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Cu cika hebak maadige kideutu ga mapeei tyeila, nah penui pe dade penui nggia kie eh peu cipau maame lungga lüt lodi. Cine pa penui kekie de tei beudi. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Ge herakesiabe minabe dade mpet lwe hebakdung lungga lütdi, nah hebak maabe pak rejaaikung kehetia ga hung eh rejaaibe ga lütdi, iciu eh penuide hegak di. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Cu tei kedidung de hebak kekwame cide ngau luge penui pakdi, nah cide namdi ga nah renam gage pau liagai. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Iciu ge minadung tei kedidung de pie zielie miedi, nah penui Jisu da gwanglu ge mina pe dade herakesiabe mpet kedibe de pe kecet de petau di nah paini de teulwe Jisu pi taiga bam eh ngaulu, iciu eh penui ngngidi. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Pecai cide kengaumedung dainzwa herakesiabe ne ngngwa kelabe de teingkeilu bi kecu penui dage paulia. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Dede Gerasenes cuikui ga kebam mina pelane Jisu de penui dade tetdi lo kiedi, penui ngngi süt kedine. Ciu eh pa caili kerane liem ga lütlu. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Mina pe dade herakesiabe mpet kedibe de pecu ngngwa la zielie pe nggia kie, dede pa pecu langgi eh, ranggai, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“N kiga gwang dai cu nah Tinggwang daipai ge n ziemne teigai bi peciakne mi dage rang lialo,” debeu. Cine pa Jisu daipai ge pe dage teigai bi cidung pelane renam ga sah rang gwangdi.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Relei tsaikedi ge nah maketeei pui ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Cu Jisu nligwang ge hemaabe penui suiyi eh pecu ngngwalu, kedanemene penui peciakne pecu kwa kebamne. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Ge ainie, cika mige pezi Jairus lie kecu ge bamla, nah pa synagogue ga muiteume ge. Nah pa Jisu pi ga keumie eh pecu peki ga gwanglo pedade pe nggia kiedi, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kedanemene pe napui mmi kereiekena nage rünsangne bamge, pa tsaina bamdi. Pa gwang kezeu dau, mina maabe pecu nyia titi ladi.<verse eid="LUK 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Cu cika mipui ge mmi kereiekena hejai lwa la kedi pui ge la, pa pe mabam pelane doctorme dage mpetdi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiukecime samkie</char><char style="fq">Pe mabam pelane doctorme dage mpetdi</char> de kecu de aika ge kaimi lakbi kesuisam luma.</note> dede migede pecu tei mmilu tadi. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Pa pecaile de pecu gwanglwe pe pairi deugai, nah hejai kelwa de kaam zette di. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Ge Jisu rangdi, “Cau acu deu no?” Mina peciakne melie dige, Peter rangdi, “Kedibo, mina maabe ncu twagwa la nah penui ncu nyia titi la.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Dede Jisu rangdi, “Mige acu deulie kedanemene ada de kengkieng mpet kedi Ih cibam di delu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Mipuibe pa mbai gai kelak ngaudi ge, pa mbeu eh gwang pe dwaga keumie di. Mina peciakne kebam gade daitei eh pa pecu deubi nah dainzwa eh pa yi zette lu dibi kecu pa ndugai. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Ciu eh pa pe dage rangdi, “A napoi, n kenlum ne ncu teihemi luda. Lungciep gade tetlu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Pa marang kesap dau, mige synagogue reu kedibe ki gade gwang eh ranggai, “N napui tsai dida, keledeube de tei keherei si talu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Dede Jisu aide siulu ge, pa sam keli eh peda cu, “Ngngi so; nlumkelu gwale, nah pa yilu zie.” <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Pa cipau kiga gwanglu ge, Peter, John nah James nah henanabe pui penai pe pei de gwale peu mi kedade pecu ngngwa lüt ma. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Cu mina peciakne hap nah pecu hei bam, dede pa rangdi, “Hap so, kedanemene pa au tsai ma, dede zip bam lu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Dede penui pa tsai kedi ci kebam ne, pecu nuidi. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Dede pa, pe ba teulwe qu eh ranggai, “Henabo, cuhlu!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ciu eh pe rabe nligwanglu, delwe pa zette cuhlu, nah pa penuide peu pecu matyei kera peulo rangbeu. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Cu pe pui pe pei penai swagahdi, dede tei kedidung de mina dage rang helo pa penuide kaamdi.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Jisu kereiekena de langkempet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Jisu caisuime kereiekenabau de qu hekwa luge, penuide herakesiabe reu pelane kengkieng nah mateeidung teingkeilu kera kengkieng pwapeu, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />delwe pa penuide Tinggwang hegwangram pwa zierang tei kera nah mateei de tei ngkeilu kerane langgai. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Pecai pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui beu ziemne magede teuso, hetui mede nsung mede tangku mede rangkang, mede ncwa kena teuso. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Nah nang ki keheige ga lüt de, cika bamlu, cipau heni gade tet dai kemaktane. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Nah kegwang leuga mi nnuide lulu mecai, nnui cipau renam gade tet mpet kecu dau, penui zierang kesia tei kegai rehi gade nnui pi gade rebui kepeu gidi lulo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Pecai penui tet lamna renamdung ga gwang eh samliakeyi teu mide ledeu nah kehei gade keteeime de teimmi ladi.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Cu Herod kedibepei ma cidung de tei kedi siupwa pecu kebwak di, kedanemene midungge John ketsai gade ringcuh daidi delie rangdi, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />nah midungge Elijah gwang dai bamlie, dede kedamedung ndaa caihakecibe kehegwame hangge cuh daidi delie kedine. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Dede Herod rangdi, “Ih John peu dang dida, dede Ih pe ha ci kenzwa dungge siu kecu de cauno?” Cine pecu ngau gai zielie pei ladi.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu mina cang mengei pukketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Cu langkegaimedung nligwanglu ge, pecu penui ta tei keludung ranglia. Iciu ge pa penuide ngngwalwe, penui nreu Bethsaida<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bethsaida: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jordan reuki kepetle kungga kebam namdi, Tiberias Jaaidi ga nlüt kecu kereuki taiga.</char></note> lie kecu nam ge ga gwangdi. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Dede hemaabe aide siu luge, penui pecaisuidi nah pa pe suiyi eh penuide ngngwalu, delwe penui dage Tinggwang hegwangram ha ranglia, nah pa mateei teihemi maikesia peda kelamedung de teingkeibeu. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Cu tingbaziebe canggwang dizeu, nah caisuime kereiekena bau peda gwang eh rangdi, “Hemaabe de peu renam twagwakebamdung ga nah luhdung ga ketyeipuk nah kezeuni ngaulu kerane penuide lang dilo, kedanemene anui renaam ga lalu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Dede pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui penuide peu tyei kera madung ge peulo.” Dede penui rangdi, “Cika anui da tangku kwak mengei nah heka pumna gwale ga, anui mie mina peciakne ziemne ketyeipuk lui zielie maige.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(Kedanemene cika mina cang mengei kenzwa ge kebamne.) Ge pane ledeukelumedung dage rangdi, “Penuide peu pemaa tei eh maage ga riakngei kenzwa ge ge bamlu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Cine penui cinzwa teilu, nah penui peciakne de peu bamlu. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Pecai pa tangku kwak mengei nah heka pumna de keulwe tinggim ngang pie eh cidungde samlam gai eh cidungde tei panglu, delwe ledeukelumedung de hemaabe dwa gage kaibeu lo eh pwabeu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Cine penui peciakne tyei eh nggeilu, nah penui tyei kebangbe, ge pesuina raptui kereiekena palu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:44">2 Heg. 4:44</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter Jisu ha kepet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Cu cinzwa eh pa ledeukelumedung de ngngwa lwe, pekatei kekie tei bam, nah pa penuide keteu eh, ranggai, “Hemaabe acu caulie lano?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Penui sam keli eh rangdi, “Duipumketeibe John. Dede kangge Elijah lie rang nah kedame rang ndaa caihakecime kakgade hangge cuh dida.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Ciu eh pa penui dage rangdi, “Dede nnuibe acu caulie lano?” Ge Peter sam keli nah rangdi, “Tinggwang Khrista.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tinggwang Khrista: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang “Keniak kelube.” Tinggwang ne kedet teu kelabe “Messaih.”</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Dede pa penuide kaambi di, aide mida gede rang helo penuide rang eh, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />ranggai, “Mina nabe ma kekiee ge keherei süt maisia, nah hangkiamedung nah cingku kedimedung nah laisiukecime ne pecu mlai dizie, delwe pecu teitsetdi zie, nah langcumne benai ringcuh dai luzie.” <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Ciu eh pa pelane dage rangdi, “Mina keheibe de a caisui keneume, pekatei pecu ketiplu maisia, nah tingba ramsang pe krus pwalwe a caisui lulo. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Kedanemene mina keheibe de pe pum kelilu keneume cide deu nggah dizie, nah mina keheibe de a ziemne pe pum nggah gaibeu liecai cide kelilu zie. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Kedanemene mige kideu pelane gie pwa pegu teilu liede, pe pumbe de teinggah di mede deu ngkapdi liecai pe kemmi daipai bam no? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Kedanemene keheibe de a ziemne nah a samdung ziemne ngngam di cai, Mina Nabe de pe kendu nah Peibe nah kemci tinggimgwame hecili eh kendu teu kegwang benai cipaude ziemne ngngam dizie. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Dede Ih nnui dage kesangbe rangzeu, cika midungge Tinggwang hegwangram kengaudwa ketsai msi kelakdung ge aika sapbam.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Teintsam kelia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Cu cide kegwang aidung rang kedi langhesetne cai Peter, John nah James penuide ngngwalu delwe pa kekie tei zielie lamlwatu ga nghangdi. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Cu pa kiebam ge, pezu rehi tsamdi, nah pe pai tinghepik kegai nzwa baaha di. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Nah ainie, mina hangna pecu mpau, Moses penai Elijah,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Moses penai Elijah: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 17:3</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />penai baaha eh, penaide peu ngaugai eh pa tetnli daikera ha rang, pa cide Jerusalem gade tei cangbeu kerade. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Cu Peter nah pecu ngngwa kelamedung zipna sütdi, dede penui nrak dailuge, penui pe kebaa nah pecu ngngwa sap kebambe kenade ngau. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Pecai mina ci kenade pe dade nreu tetdi kezeudau, Peter Jisu dage rangdi, “Keledeubo, anui aika bam de yi zielie. Cu anui ha kecum teigo, ket n ziemne, nah ket Moses ziemne, nah ket Elijah ziemne” (pa daipai rang au bi pa ci ma.) <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Dede pa aide rang kebam dau, hemwa ge gwang penuide gumlu, nah penui hemwa lungga lüt keludau penui ngngidi. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Pecai makwa ge hemwa gade rangpet eh ranggai, “Aide a na, Ih kedetkelube; pe sam kingneilu.” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Cu makwa de rangcangdi ge, Jisu katei bam eh ngaulu. Cine penui mlei ma nah cipau tingdau magede penui kengaudung migede ranglia ma.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herakesiabe kela na ge de teikengkei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Cu cide gwang pecai benai penui lamlwatu gade nghunglu ge maadi ge pecu redaulu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Ciu eh ainie, hemaabe gade mige sahbak eh, “Keledeubo, a napei de pie gailo, Ih n dade a nggia kiela, kedanemene pa au a na pumli na lu. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Cu ainie, marabe ge ne pecu tui teudi, nah pa zette nradi la, nah pa petei ndet eh pe mcai tapet dila. Nah pecu tei mnei kedi caide pecu püt raubi didi zeu. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nah nang ne ledeukelumedung de cide gwadi lo Ih a nggia kie, dede penui teilu meda.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Ciu eh Jisu sam keligai, “Oh nlumkemak nah mikai kemak ceheu, Ih daitie ge nnuide ngngwa eh a lung tiela laino? N napei de aika ngngwa gwanglo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Henanabe gwang kezeu dau, herakesiabe pecu keling mie eh petei ndetlwe pecu tei kera di. Dede Jisu mcikemak rabe de kesiu gai delwe henanabe de teingkeibeu eh pecu pwa pe peide peu daidi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ciciuge penui peciakne Tinggwang kengkieng kedi ngau eh penui swagah di. Dede pa tei kegai pelane de cet eh penui macang kebam dau, ledeukelume dage pa rangdi, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Sam aidungde peu nnui kün ga lüt lulo: kedanemene Mina Nabe de minadung ba gage tui gaidi lau delu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Dede penui sam aide cilu ma, cide penui dade hekim kedine, cine penui cide cetlu ma, ciciuliede sam aide kie pe dade penui keteu ngngi di.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Caube ditube lai?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Pecai penui kakgade cau ne ditu ziebi rang eh kesamlimdi. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Dede, Jisu penui lungning ci luge, pa hename gede ngngwa pwa petai gage pecu kailu, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />nah penui dage rangdi, “Keheibe de a zi gade hena ainade de ngngwa kelume, acu ngngwa lula; nah acu ngngwa kelume acu langkegaibe de ngngwa lula. Kedanemene nnui peciakne kak gade ceutube au, pa kedibe delu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />John pe sam keli nah rangdi, “Kedibo, anui mige n zi gade herakesiabe de gwala eh ngau, nah anui pecu kaam dida, kedanemene pa anui caisui melu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Dede Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Pecu kaam so, kedanemene keheibe de nnuide mmau kemakme au nnui kilam delu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samariame mcaukedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Cu pecu ngngwa tinggim ga nghangdi kera ting mna gwangdi kezeu dau, pa Jerusalem ga hang kerale ge pema nghwa gaidi. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Pecai pa samgwame de pedwa mrai langnswa gaidi, nah penui gwang eh Samariame nam gega lüt, pe ziemne ma mtei kerane. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Dede minadung pecu ngngwa lak lie di, kedanemene pa Jerusalem ga hang kerale pema nghwa gai kedine. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Cu ledeukelume kena James penai John aide ngau luge, penai rangdi “Rampaubo, nang peu anaide tinggim gade mi kie nghunglo ranggai eh penuide ru kedi nsui mi?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Dede Jisu nreugwang penaide kesiu gai, <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />nah penui renam keda gage gwangdi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu caikesui mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Cu penui lampui ga mie kela dau, mige pe dage rangdi, “Nang kegwang leuga Ih de n caisui zielie.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Dede Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Maiserungdung penui kuiki bam, nah tingkam ruine de penui ciep bam, dede Mina Nabe au pe peu kezeubam de gah.” <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Pecai pa kedage dage rangdi, “A caisuilu.” Dede pa rangdi, “Rampaubo, peu acu keraibe gwang delwe a pei de kungdi rielo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Dede pa pe dage rangdi, “Ketsaime de peu ketsaime de kunglu. Dede n ziemne au, mie Tinggwang hegwangram ha mide ledeu lo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Pecai cude kedage rangdi, “Ih n caisui zie, Rampaubo, dede peu acu a kilung ga kebammedung de gwang keresiu railo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Heg. 19:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Dede Jisu sam keli eh, “Migede, hepei pwalwe cainok gwang pie cai, Tinggwang hegwangram name teilu dau gailak.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Jisu mina riakhenaekena de langkempet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Cu aidungde cia, Rampaube mina keda 72<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aika nah 10:17 ga, kesa kehegwa laisiudung </char><char style="fq">72</char>, nah keda, <char style="fqa">70 de peila</char>. Laisiukecime daide be petau ziebi kesuizwa luma.</note> de kedetlu, delwe pa pekatei gwang kera renam ramsangga nah heni leune gage mina hangna na eh penuide mrai langgai. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Luhlüt kera kiesüt zeu, dede heta keteime au cam lie. Ciziemne luhlüt Rampaube de peu pe luh gage hetaketeime de langgailu kerane kielu. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Nnui lampui ga rip gwang kwacu. Ainie, Ih nnuide meurünnadung nzwa heneudung kakga ge langgai zeu. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Rangkangbung ge, mede hebeuh nsung ge, mede picumdung de pung so, mede lampui gade migede de kelum so. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Nnui ki keheiga lüt de, keraibe, ‘Lungciepbe de peu ki aika bam kelube tei lulo!’ de eh ranglu. <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Lungciep na ge bamcai, nnui lungciep peda bam luzie; dede mecai, cide nnui da gwang dailu zie. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Cu ki cika bam jüja lu, penui ne pwa kepeube tyei nah sak eh, kedanemene ma keteime pe ziehi ngau kerabe lu. Kige gade kige ga gwang so. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Nah nnui namdi keheiga kelüt ga, mi nnuide ngngwa kelu dau, nnui dwa gage kai kebeube tyeilu, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />nah cika keteeime de teingkeibeu nah penui dage, ‘Tinggwang hegwangram nnui da mna bamdi delie,’ de eh rang lialu. <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Cu nnui renam keheiga kelüt dau, nah mi nnuide ngngwalu mecai, lampui ga mie eh rang lo, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Nnui nam rebui anui pi ga kup kebam de anui nnuide mmau eh hemui mpet gaila! Dede aide ci lulo, Tinggwang hegwangram au gwang mna bam dida.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, cipaunai cipau namdi de swa Sodom be lialu yiki zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Ken. 19:24</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 19:25">25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Ainie, Chorazin! Ainie, Bethsaida! Magade heta kedi nnai dage tei kegaidung de Tyre penai Sidon namdi gage teigai cai, penai au ndaage rosopai nah mimüt teu eh penai helungnreu luzie delu. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Dede hetu ketiak benai n ziemne swa Tyre penai Sidon ziemne lialu yiki zie. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Nah nang, Capernaum, ncu tei cehu pwa tinggim tung zielie bamni? Ncu tei hena pwa Hades gage kaidi zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13">Isa. 14:13</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 14:15">15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Nnui kwa kingnei kelube a kwade kingnei lula, nah nnuide mlai kelabe acu de mlai lala, nah acu mlai kelabe acu langkegaibe de mlai la.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Ciu eh Mina riakhenaekena bau de penui suiyi eh nligwang eh, ranggai, “Rampaubo, herakesiabedung de n zi gade anui kanglie.” <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Ih Satan tinggim gade ting kehepik nzwa hungkecu ngau bam. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Ainie, Ih nnuide heneidung nah heruinegapuidung reude daulu kebui, nah nnui ngauraume reude kengkieng peu dida, nah magede nnuide tei rezam lak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Lei. 91:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Iciuliede, herakesiadung nnui kang kedi ziemne nnui suiyi so, dede tinggim ga nnui zi raupwa zeudi kecune nnui suiyi lulo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Cipau bamdakkak gade pa Kemci Rabe gade pe suiyi süt eh rangdi, “Ih ncu twa, a Pei, tinggim nah kideu Rampaubo, kedanemene nang ma aidungde keci kecetmedung dade kebaih teula eh, pwa henamedung de lia kegaine. Yeo, a Pei, iciu kecu nang nlungning delu.” <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“A Pei ne ma pelane acu nlumbeu dida, nah Peibe gwale migede Nabe caubi cima, nah Nabe gwale migede Peibe caubi cima nah peu lia zielie kedet kelume gwale pecu ci gailak.” <verse eid="LUK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Cipaucai pa nreu gwang ledeukelumedung dage nkim eh rangdi, “Nnui kengaudung pemiakle kengaumedung au samlam pungtu! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Kedanemene Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, caihakecime nah hegwangme kekiee nnui kengau de ngauneu, nah cide ngau luma; nah nnui kesiude siuneu gwang, nah siulu ma.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samariame keyibe samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Cu ainie, Jewme zai kecime ge pecu kedak zielie saplwe ranggai, “Keledeubo, Ih kelungta kering ngaulu kerane daipai tei maisia no?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Dede pa pe dage rangdi, “Hezai ga daipai raupwa lano? Nang dainzwa cide pei lano?” <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Pa samkeli eh rangdi, “Nang Tinggwang n Rampaube de n mlung pelane teu, nah n keringria pelane teu, nah n kengkieng pelane teu, nah n kecet pelane teu kulu zie, nah n kidabe de n katei ncu nzwa kulu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Hez. 6:5</ref>;<ref loc="DEU 10:12">10:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Pa pe dage rangdi, “Nang rangdau da. Aide teilu, iciude nang ring luzie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev. 18:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Dede pa pekatei pecule nzeulie neu eh, Jisu dage rangdi, “Cau a kidabe no?” <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Jisu sam keli eh rangdi, “Mige Jerusalem gade Jericho ga hungla ge pa sütketyeimedung kakga kaumie di, ge pe paini de gaudi nah penui pecu daptset nage gai eh tetdi. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Cu cidau cingkume ge lampui cika tet nghung, nah pa pecu ngaulu ge, pa pe nbie kedale de mria tetdi. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Cu cinzwa Levime gede, pa heni cika kegwang dau pecu ngaulu pe nbiele de mria tetdi. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Dede Samariame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Samariame: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Samariame au Jewme ngaurautume ndaage de. Penui hange ge de ncüt lamah.</char></note> ge, pa mbeu keladau, pa kebamni ga gwanglu, nah pa pecu ngau luge, pa ngau nggiadi. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Cine peda gwang eh maca nah zau ruigai eh pe rejam jamdung kangdi. Delwe pecu pekaune reuga ge teu gailu hebeuhki ga ngngwa gwanglu, delwe pema pielu. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Nah pecai benai pa denarii kena keu mpetlu, nah hebeuh ki kekwabe de peu eh rangdi, ‘Pema pielu, nah nang keheige mpet sidi de, Ih nligwang kecu dau, Ih ncu peudai zie.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Cipaume hangcum de n kecet gade caube sütketyeime kakga kauzeu kebambe gu kidabe no?” <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Pa rangdi, “Pecu ngaunggia kebeube de.” Ge Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Gwang eh nang cinzwa tei lulo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Martha penai Mary ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Cu penui penui lampui ga gwang zeuge, pa renam gega lütlu, nah mipui ge pezi Martha pecu ngngwa gwang pekilung gwanglu. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Cu pa pe sinabepui Mary lie kecu ge bam, pa Jisu pibang ga bam eh pe keledeu sam kingnei bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Dede Martha au ma telei süt kebam ziemne leudi, nah pa gwang eh rangdi, “Rampaubo, a sinabepui acu pütdi eh akatei ma lamlui kebam, nang cide cetbam meni? Ciziemne, pecu acu nghalo de pe dage rang gailo.” <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Dede Rampaube pe sam keli eh pe dage rangdi, “Martha, Martha, Nang au ma kekieege teineu eh nlungnei bam, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />dede mage au teu maisia. Kedanemene Maria au keyi lambie kedet luda, cide pe dade keuteu di gailak.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Jisu kekie ciem keledeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Tingnai ge Jisu henige gade pa kekie teibam ge, pa kie cangdi ge, pa ne ledeukelu hangge pe dage rangdi, “Rampaubo, anuide kekie tei kera ledeu lialo, John de pa ne ledeukelume de ledeu kebeu nzwa.” <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Nah pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui kekie keteidau ainzwa ranglu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Apei, n zi kemci depeu hetwapung lulo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">N hegwangram tei gwang kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Tingnai ramsangne puk anuide peulo.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Nah anui maudung gibeu lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">Kedanemene anui de mi anui</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">dage kemau teikegaime mau gibeu lalu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">anui mi kedame mau gibeu kemaktane, Tinggwang anui mau gibeu lak.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Nah anuide mdakkepie gage kai diso.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Pecai pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui kakgade caube pe zangme ge bam eh, tingmuisum dauge peda mie eh, ‘Azangbo, acu tangku kwak cum releu beulo de rang zieno, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />a zangme ge mbeu la eh gwang kebam ne, nah Ih magede pecu pwapeu kera galu’? <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Pecai pa pelung gade keli eh rang lubui, ‘Acu teinang so. Cu kikambe ngkui dida, nah a namedung acu ngngwa zeu bam. Ih cuh lwe ncu magede peu gailak ta.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Ih nnui dage rangla, pa pe zangbe kecune cuh lwe pecu magede peu melie de, dede pa kiebi kedi ziemne pa cuh lwe pa teu mai kesia kieege pecu peuzie. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Nah Ih nnui dage rangla, kielu, iciude cide nnuide peuzie; peeilu, nah nnui ngaulu zie; ketunglu, nah cide nnuide ngkei beu zie. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kie kelame leu ngaulu la; nah peei kelabe de ngaulu la; nah ketung kelabede de ngkei beu zie. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Nah nnui kakgade cau pei ge, magade pe na heka kie cai, pa heka mding gade pecu henei peu lano?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung au rau tie nzeu, Mat. 7:9 gade ngau luzie</char><char style="fqa">Nnui kakgade cau pei ge, magade n napei tangku kwak kie cai, nang tangtsu peu zieni? Mede heka, nang henei peu zieni?</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Mede pa nruibum kiege pecu heruinegapui peula no? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Ciziemne, nnui kesiame de ma keyibedung nnui name de kepeu cim cicai, nnui Pei tinggim ga kebambe au Kemci Rabe pe dade kie kelame de daikenzwa gede peu kiee si zie no?”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nah Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Cu Jisu pelet kegame ge dade herakesiabe de gwa bamdi. Nah herakesiabe mpet kedi dau, pelet kegabe de maranglu, ge hemaabe penui swagahdi. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Dede midung ge rangdi, “Pa herakesiabedung reu kedibe Beelzebul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beelzebul: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Greekme let gade aipau sam ga, Satan de “Beelzebul” de qu. “Beelzebul” au Tinggwang de nlumla kemakme rabe, nah mina aipau zi Satan de rang eh keula</char></note> de ngngwa hera kesiabedung de gwala.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Kedame pecu kedei eh, pedade tinggim gade marehi teilialo kiedi. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Dede pa penui lungning cibam nah pa penui dage rangdi, “Hegwangram leune de pe katei pecu pungpang di cai kap di la, nah ngngwa ket teilu kemakbe ki kaudi la. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Dede magade Satan liede pelam tsam eh kengaurau cai pe hegwangram dainzwa saplu lai? Kedanemene nnui Ih Beelzebul de ngngwa herakesiabe de gwala lie rangzeu. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Cu Ih magade Beelzebul zi gade herakesiabe de gwa cai, n caisuimedung cau zi gade cidungde de gwa mpet lano? Aide ziemne, penui ne nnui tutiakme tei zie. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Dede magade Ih Tinggwang kengkieng teu herakesiabe de gwala lie cai, iciucai Tinggwang hegwangram gwang nnui da cangbam dida. <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Dede kengkiengme ge pe reunet teulwe pe ki kwabam dicai, pegu mabamdung kwakbam lula, <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />dede peswa ngkiengki kecu gene pecu tuilu ge, pa pecu ngam luzie, pa nlum kebam reunet de keutet kap dila, nah pe mabamdung nzi lula. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Acu ngngwa la kemakpe au acu mmau la, nah acu ngngwa hekwa la kemakpe au teuzang la. <verse eid="LUK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Mcikemak rabe mige dade mpet kedi dau, pa mtak kera pe bam pei eh dui kega gadung kah gwang, dede kette ngaulu mege, pa ranggai, ‘Ih kegwang a ki dega Ih cailigwang dai dizie.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Nah pa cailigwang ge, cide biak di eh mtei siakte pwa kebam ngaulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Ge pa mie heradung keda peswa siaki kecu hena de ngngwa gwang silu nah penui cika lung kerane gwanglu. Pecai cipau peide kerai dau swa kekamle siaki dila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Pa aidung de rangdi ge, hemaa gade mipui ge sahbak eh pe dage rangdi, “Mipui peza gage ncu tetlak kelube pui nah nang petung tung eh kelungbe pui de samlam pungtu delie.” <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Dede pa rangdi, “Iciumeliene, Tinggwang sam kingnei lwe cide mzai kelame samlam pungtu.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jonah zasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Hemaabe kie reu reu dige, pa rang cuhdi, “Aipau ceheu de ceheu kesiage. Cide marehi ge peeila, ciude marehi gede penuide teilia lakta, Jonah dage tei kelia rehi de gwale. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Kedanemene Ninevehme ziemne Jonah marehi tei keliage nzwa, aipau ceheude ziemne Mina Nabe de cinzwa zie. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Tingbang lebie Hegwangpui<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hegwangpui: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sheba</char></note> mina aipau ceheude de ngngwalwe tutiak ga sap zie, nah penuide mmau zie, kedanemene pa kideu nlile de Solomon maci sam kingnei zielie kegwang ziemne, nah ainie, Solomon swa diki kecuge aika bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Heg. 10:1-10</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 9:1">2 Heg. 9:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Ninevehme aipau ceheu de de ngngwa lwe tutiak ga sap zie nah cide de mmau dizie, kedanemene Jonah keledeu gade penui helungnreu kelune, nah ainie, mige Jonah, swade diki kecuge aika bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5-10">Jon. 3:5-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mipum mitaubung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Migede mitaubung ge mtau kelucai, pwa kebai mede marak kangga ge kaidi lama, dede mitaubam reu gage kaila, iciu eh ki ga kelütme de peu kebaa de ngaulu kerane. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />N miak de n pum mitaubung da. N miak yi kebamdau, n pum pelane de gi n baa lula. Dede cide sia dige, n pum de kemuine puidi la. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ciziemne, sünnelu ciude nda kebaa kelade muidi melu kerane. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Ciziemne magade n pum pelane baaha bamcai, zi gede kemui kepui gahcai, cika kebaa kepui teibam zie, mitaubung pe kebaa nnuide taumbaa keladau nzwa eh.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kerehim herok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Cu pa marang canglu ge, Phariseeme ge pe dade pecu ngngwa matyei lodi. Pa lütlu delwe taktyeibam ga ngngeilu. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Ge Phariseebe matyei kemak dwa pa keraibe pe ba mtiak kemak ngau eh pe swa gahdi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jisu matyei kera ntumlu. Jewme zai gade heba kemtiak zaide keraibe teila.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Dede Rampaube pe dage rangdi, “Nnui Phariseeme hekwak hepiak hegwale hui mci la, dede nnui lungle au makehengin nah kesia le puila. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Nnui kemiemedung! Hegwale tei kegaibe ne helungle de teigai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:40 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Helungle de teigai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aide ranggai kecu Tinggwang, “mipum” tei kegaibe, “keringria” de teigai lie.</char></note> meni? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Dede pe lungga dai bambi mide peulo, nah pielo, ma pelane nnui ziemne mci luzie.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Dede ainie Phariseemedung da keherei gwang zieda, kedanemene mihui nah rue de nah ginei pelane de zi kerei tei eh zige kaila, dede nnui masang nah Tinggwang keku gi dida. Dede aidungde tei kerabe, nah kedabedung de gidi mene. <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Ainie, Phariseemedung da keherei gwang zieda, kedanemene nnui synagoguedung ga hebam yitube ga bam neula nah litaknidung gade kelum kegai luuneu kelane. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Ainie, nnui teilu buida, kedanemene nnui heraudung tei heci kemakbe, nah mina ci mene pereu ga tetkah kelabe nzwa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Pecai hezai keledeumedung hangge pe sam keli eh pe dage rangdi, “Keledeubo, nang aidung de rang eh, anuide de hega zeu.” <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Dede pa keligai, “Ainie, nnui hezai keledeumedung de! Kedanemene nnui hepüt kerütle mina püt teirüt beu la, dede nnui nnui katei be hepütdung nnui zurangdung ket lede deu lama. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Ainie nnui da keherei gwang zieda, kedanemene nnui caihakecime rau tei, dede nnui peime ne penuide teitset di. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Cine nnui nnui peime ta zierangme nah cide petau delie kelamedung delie, kedanemene penui penuide teitsetdi kesang, nah nnui penui raudung teibeu kelane. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Cine aipau kie de ziemne de, Tinggwang macisam rangdi, ‘Ih penui dage caihakecime nah langkegaimedung de langgai zie, penui mina kangge de teikeherei nah teitset zie.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ciziemne, kideu tei kelu gade caihakecime pelane jai lwa kedi de aipau ceheu dade kie zie, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Abel jai gade gwang Zechariah jai kecang, recabam nah kerecaki kakgade teitset kedibe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrewme gu laisiukwak ga Kendeu laisiukwak raitube tei eh Heleuhha Kenabe laisiukwak de kamtube lie la.</char></note> Yeo, Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, cide aipau ceheu dade luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Ken. 4:8</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 24:20-22">2 Hel. 24:20-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Ainie hezai keledeumedung da keherei gwang zieda, nnui maci cabibe keuteu kedine; nnuide lüt luma, nah nnui lüt kelamede de kaam dila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Pa cikade tetdi ge, laisiukecime nah Phariseemedung pecu renia sütdi nah pecu ma kekiee rang mmau di, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />pe samrang gade pecu tui kera kwabamdi.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Rangkemriak nah teikengkuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Cipau tingdau mina pecang gwang ngkwa kelu dau penui hangge ge reu daudi, ge pa ledeukelume dage rang eh, “Nnui Phariseeme gu tsehi, cide hezai ketei gade mriak lulo. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Dede magede keulia laklie gum kenzeu galie, mede peu cilak lie kebai kenzeu galie. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Cine makeheibe de nang kemui gade rang kedide kebaa ga siu zie, nah nang kibung kecuk kengkim gade cüt kegaide kireu gade sah gaidi zielie. <verse eid="LUK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Dede Ih nnui dage rangla, a zangmedung, mipum teitset kelame de hing so, nah pecai penui ciswa magede teisi gailak lu. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Dede nnui caude hing buibi Ih rangmriak beuzie. Teitset kelucai mijaai gage keliengai dilu kebui kengkieng kebambe de hinglu. Yeo, Ih nnui dage rangzeu, Tinggwang de hinglu. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Tangkine mengeile rangkanggeu kena gade zwala me luini? Ciuliede cidung de ket liede Tinggwang dwade nsungta dila ma. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Dede nnui peu tamdung kecangde peilu da. Ngngi so. Nnui au tangkine kekiee ge swade nnui mi hungki lu. <verse eid="LUK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Dede Ih nnui dage rang zeu, peciakne de mina dwade a ha rang kelame, Mina Nabe de Tinggwang gu tinggimgwamedung dwade pe ha rang zie, <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />dede keheibe de mina dwade a ha rangmei di cai Tinggwang gu tinggimgwame dwade pe ha rangmei dizie. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Nah keheibe de Mina Nabe de samge rang mmau lade, pemau gibeu zie, dede kemci Rabe de rangmsia kelame mau gibeu lak. <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Mi nnuide synagoguedung ga nah kedimedung nah kengkieng teu kelame da ngngwa kegwang dau, nnui dainzwa mede nang daipai sam rang ziebi mede nnui daipai rang ziebi cet eh n nuilung nei so, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />kedanemene Kemci Rabe cipau bamdakkak ga nnui daipai rang mai siabi nnuide ledeu beu zielu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kehei kemiebe samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Pecai hemaa gade mige pe dage rangdi, “Keledeubo, a sinabe de acu de mabam de mzi beulo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mabam de mzi beulo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mabam au pe name de pe pei ne lungdiak kebeu lie.</char></note> rang beulo.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Dede Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Minabo, caune acu nnai tuketiakbe mede nnai kakga hekak ketetbe teigai beuno?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Tet. 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Pecai pa penui dage rangdi, “Mriaklu nah nnuikatei nnuide kehengim pelane gade kezeu lulo, kedanemene mina teilung pe mabam kekiee ga bam swalu la melu.” <verse eid="LUK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Pecai pa penui dage samgwa ge rang eh, “Keheime pei ge luhga ma lung hemi süt lu, <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />nah pa pe katei pelung gade mning eh, rang eh, ‘Ih daipai tei lai, kedanemene Ih a tsiu hekwa kera bam gah da?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Cine pa rangdi, ‘Ih aide tei zie: Ih a ciuki ralwe tei mdisi zie, nah Ih cika ge a ciu pelane nah a gunia kedabedungde kai hekwa zie. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Pecai Ih a keringria dage rangzie, “A keringria, nang ma kekiee ge mmi kekiee teulu kera hekwalu da. Relui lu, tyei sak eh nsuiyi lu.”’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Dede Tinggwang pe dage rangdi, “Kemiebo, heziu n dade n keringria keudi zieda, nah nang hema mtei keludung de, cide caube gu zie no? <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Cine cipaude au pekatei pe ziemne hema hekwa lwe Tinggwang kilam mahei kemak kauge delie.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helung keherei so</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Pecai pa ledeukelumedung dage rangdi, “Aide ziemne Ih nnui dage rangla, nnui teilung ziemne n nuilung keherei so, daipai tyei zie no, mede nnui pum daipai paini ba nni zie no de eh. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kedanemene teilung au ketyeipok swade di nah mipum au paiheni swa diki reulu. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Nruinedung zai cet gai pielo, penui heleuh gila ma nah rum de lama. Penui hema kehekwa ki mede ciuki de bam ma, dede Tinggwang penui pok teila. Nnui daikenzwa kieege nruine swade nnui mi hungki reuno!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 147:9">Lei. 147:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Dede nnui caube pelung keneile pwane pe teilung cubit ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mede banim kereieheset.</char></note> teitie silu laino? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Cine nnui ma keceu cikenzwa nage de tei gailak liecai, daitei eh nnui kedabedung ziemne nnui lung nei lano? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Teizuine pa zai cet gailo, penui dainzwa lungh labi. Penui mata tei lama, mede helang de zang lama. Dede Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, Solomon pe pwa keyi pelane bahlu liede aidungde kette nzwa luma. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Cu magade Tinggwang tsehei luh ga, henai lung kebam, nah ncünne mimang gage kelien gaidi kela de de pepwa teibeu la liecai, daikenzwa kieege pa nnui pwa tei beu zie no, O nnui kenlum kecammedung! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Cine nnui daipai tyei ziebi nah daipai sak ziebi de peei so, nah nnui lungnei so. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Kedanemene kideu ga heleuh pelane de aidungde peeila, nah nnui Pei nnui cidung keumai kesia ci. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Dede nnui Tinggwang hegwangram peeilu, nah ma aidung pelane de si eh nnuide peusi zie. <verse eid="LUK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Ngngi so, hemaa kecam nabo, kedanemene nnuide hegwangram peu kera nnui Pei suidi delu. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Nnui mabam zwadi delwe kegame de mapeu lo. Rangkangbung sia dila kemakbe nnui ziemne tei lulo, tinggim ga mabam madaude gahdi kelak ga, keregame gwang nna gai kelak, nah taklei nede teimsiadi kelak ga. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kedanemene n mabam kebam ga, cika n mlung de bam zielu.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwasünne kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Nnui kiakang de peu kangpung bamlu nah nnui mitaubung de peu heu bamlu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang ta tei kera telei lwe bam muilu. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />nah mina penui mpaube meunui ngyi gade caili kegwang kwa kebamme nzwa lu, iciu eh pa gwang eh ketung kegai dau, penui zette pecu kikam ngkei pwa peulu kerane. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Rampaube kegwangdau kilame kwa bam eh penuide peu ngau kelume samlam pungtu da. Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, pe katei pekia kanglwe penuide peu taktyeibam ga bamzie, nah pa gwang penuide taktyei rengei beuzie. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Pe mpaube kekwating kenabe mede kecumbe <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kekwating kenabe mede kecumbe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">muisum dau mede naimiak kepetle kakga</char></note>gade gwang cai, nah penui kwabam eh ngau lucai kila cidungde samlam pungtu da. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Dede aide cilu, magade kilung mpaube daipau bamdakkak ga keregabe gwang ziebi cide ci cai, pa peu pe ki raklwe lüt lak. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Nnui de mteilu, kedanemene Mina Nabe au nnui cet kemak bamdakkak gage gwang zielu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Ge Peter rangdi, “Rampaubo, nang samgwa aide anui ziemne rangzeu ni, mi pelane ziemne rangzeu no?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Ge Rampaube rangdi, “Ciciu cai caube samsang nah makeci kikwabe no, cipaude de pe mpaube ne kedetlu eh kilame peureu bam eh penuide peting siakdau ketyeipuk penui lie peu kera? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Pe mpaube kegwang dau iciu bam eh ngaulu kela kilabe de samlampungtu delie. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ih kesangsiakbe nnui dage rangzeu, pa mina cipaude de peu pe mabam pelane reu kedibe tei zie. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Dede kila cipaude pe katei pe lung gade, ‘A mpaube gwang kera peting keu tiezie,’ nah kila pei nah kilapuidung de dap, nah tyei nah sak eh, nah sakmie bamcai, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />kila cipaude mpaube pa cet bam kemak tingba, bamdakkak nah pa ci kemakdau gwang zie, nah pecu dang takcai dizie nah pecu samsangkemakme lamge kaidi zie. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Dede cipau kilabe pe mpaube lungning cilu, dede mteilu ma mede pelungning nzwa teilu mecai, pecu dapsüt zie. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Dede mige ci mene bam, nah daplu kebui tadung ge tei dicai, pecu dap cam zie. Dede peu kie kebeu keheibe dade keu kiee zie, nah nlum kieeki kebeube dade kie kieegwa zie.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngngwakeyi maa dade pangkepop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Ih kideu gage mi kaibeu kera gwang, nah Ih cide peu heu bam di lie neu de lie. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Dede Ih duipum, tei kera duipum ge bam, nah Ih cide teicanglu kemaktane a lungnei bam! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Ih kideu ga kezuyi peu kerane gwanglie nnui cet lani? Ma, Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, meliene pang kepop. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Kedanemene cu gade kilung gega hang mengei pangpop dizie, hangcum hangna de mmau nah hangna hangcum de mmau dizie. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Penui pangpop di zie, pepei pena de mmau nah pe na pe pei de mmau; pe pui pe napui de mmau nah pe napui pe pui de mmau; pe nai pe geipui de mmau nah pe geipui pe nai de mmau zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mic. 7:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Pa hemaabe dage rangsi eh, “Nnui naimiak kenlütle hemwa ge him cuh kecu ngaude, nnui zette, ‘Tingrui gwangzeu,’ de rangla, nah ciciu kesangla. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Nah tingbangle tingkaigui gaige, ‘Tinglum zie da,’ de rangla, nah iciu kesangla. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Hezai teikelamedung! Nnui kideu nah tingzu rangci lula, dede dainzwa nnui cudau ting ha rangmci lula meno? <verse eid="LUK 12:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Nah nnuikatei daitei eh petaube cet lula meno? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Kedanemene n ngauraube de ngngwa hetuketiakbe dwa mie keladau, lampui gade pelung tei nciepdi kera nlaikai teilu iciude pa ncu tutiakbe da teugwang melu kerane, nah tutiakbe ncu langpwa kedibe ba gage kaidi melu kerane, nah kedibe ncu hebaangki gage kaidi melu kerane. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, nang peusa keceu kamtu nabe de de kapdi kemaktane nang madaude mpet gailak.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Helung nreulumecai kekap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Cipau tingdau cika kebam midungge Jisu dage Pilate Galileeme midungge de penui ratak tei kebam dau teitsetdi lie rangbeu. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Nah Jisu penui sam keli eh, “Penui iciu eh keherei kecu nnui Galileeme cidungde Galileeme kedamedung swa mau kilie cet lani? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Melie, Ih nnui dage ranggaila. Dede nnui helungnreu lumai, nnui pelane de cinzwa kap dizie. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Mede mina hang kereieheset reu Siloam ga renei meumie penuide teitset kedimedung, nnui kecet cidungde Jerusalem ga kelungme pelane swa mauki lie eh cet bamni? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Melie, Ih nnuide ranglia zie. Dede nnui helungnreu lumai, nnui pelane de cidungde nzwa kap dizie.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Pecai pa samgwa aide rang, “Mige pe gurie gage tangzütbang ge ling pwa bam, nah pa cika petsi peei gwang, dede ngaulu ma. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Nah pa hegurie kekwabe dade rangdi, ‘Ainie, Ih mmi kecum ge aipau tangzütbang tsi de pei eh gwang nah kette ngau luma. Cide bi di. Daitei cide peu heni teingkap bamlai?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Dede hegurie kekwabe pe mpaube dage keligai, ‘Kedibo, peu cide de hekum de bamlu rielo, Ih cide tei ndu nah tangnia keyi kaigai kecu dau. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Magade cide ngkikum petsi builu cai yida; dede bui mecai, nang cide bidi lubui!’”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pi kesia pui ge de Sabbath benai tei kengkei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Pa Sabbath benai synagogue ge ga mide ledeu bam, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />nah cika mipui ge bam pecu mmi kereieheset ge kemnei peukela rabe ge ne pecu tei mnei eh bam, pa pekiabwak eh nzang nzuilu tadi. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Cu Jisu pecu ngau keludau, pa pecu qu nna gai, nah pedage rangdi, “Mipoe, n kemneidung teihemi beu dida.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Nah pa pereu gage pe ba hwagai, ge pa nzang zette lu eh pa Tinggwang de twadi. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Dede synagogue reu kedibe pelung tsamdi kedanemene Jisu Sabbath benai mide teingkei kebeune<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sabbath benai mide teingkei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jewme cetla aide Sabbath zai gi kah lie, hezai kaibeu pemdaibe tei helo kebeube tei eh.</char></note>, samkeli nah hemaabe dage rangdi, “Heta tei kera tingba lang herokne bam. Cine cidau gwang mide teingkeilu, dede Sabbath benai so.” <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Dede Rampaube pe sam keligai nah rangdi, “Hezai teikelamedung! Nnui ket ket kecu Sabbath benai pe tumseu mede pe gada peki gade hiaklwe ngngwa mie peu dui sakla meni? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Dede aipau mipui de Abraham leuh napui ge, Satan ne pecu mmi kereieheset ge kangteu kela Sabbath benai hebaang aide gade pecu lungmpet peu kerabe meni?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Nah pa aidungde rang kegai dau, pecu reniakelamedung ngngam di, dede hemaabe peciakne pa ma kendu tadung tei kegaidung ziemne penui suiyi sütdi.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zeigi tsi nah tsehi samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Ge pa rangdi, “Tinggwang hegwang daipai nzwano? Nah Ih cide daipai le keu keda lai? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Cide au ziegi tsi pumge mige pe gurie gage mrok kegai nzwa, nah cide lungh cuhlwe tsingbang kedi teilu, nah tinggim ruinedung pekiak gage penui ciep teulu kela nzwa delie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rabbanic zai ga “ziegi tsi” de kecu pekie au mage ceusüt kecu ria gage rang bamla. Israel ga ziegi bang au mabang keceu ge nzwa lung la nah pekiak ga nruine peki teila.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Ge pa rangdai eh, “Ih Tinggwang hegwang daipai de keu kedagai laino? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Cide au mipui ge cehi teu tokkui kecum mdet ge gage ruiza gai eh haikap kelu nzwa da.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kikam kenrumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Pecai pa renam kedi nah keceu gadung mie ledeu eh tetkah gwang Jerusalem lege tet gaidi. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Ge mige pe dade keteudi, “Rampaubo, kelikelume cam zieni?” Ge pa penui dade keligai, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Herie kenrumbe gade lütkera nnui laikai teilu, kedanemene, Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, mina kekiee lütkera peei zie, dede lüt gailak. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Ki mpaube kikambe cuh lwe ngkui dizie, nah nnui hegwale saplwe kikambe kekung eh rangzie, ‘Rampaubo, anuide ngkei beulo.’ Dede pa keli eh nnui dage rangzie, ‘Ih nnui de cima, dai gade gwang labi.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Pecai nnui rang cu zie, ‘Anui nang kebam gade matyei nah masak da, nah nang anui lampui gade ledeu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Dede pa keli zie, ‘Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, nnui dai gade gwang labi Ih cima. Nnui kesia keteimedung, a dade tet dilu!’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Lei. 6:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Cipau ni gade, hap nah geigim pungbam dizie, cidau nnui Abraham, Isaac, Jacob, nah caihakecime peciakne Tinggwang hegwangram ga bam eh ngau zie, dede nnuide kelien mpet dida. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Nah penui naimiak kepetle nah kenlütle, nah tingtünle de nah tingbangle de gwang zie nah Tinggwang hegwang bamga bamzie. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Nah ainie, kekamme raidi zie, nah keraime kamdi zie.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Cipau bamdakkak dau, Phariseeme dungge peda gwanglwe rangdi, “Aika de tet dilu, kedanemene Herod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Herod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herod Antipas</char></note> ncu teitset dineu bam kedine.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Cine pa penui dade rangdi, “Gwang delwe cipau maiserung Herod dage rangbeu, ‘Ainie, Ih herakesiabe de gwa, nah Ih henai penai ncünne mide teingkei zie, nah langcumne benai a ta teicang dizie.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Dede Ih henai, nah ncünne, nah pecai benai tet la maisia, nah kedanemene caihakecime ge Jerusalem gwale de tsaidi daulak lu. <verse eid="LUK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Jerusalem, Jerusalem, caihakecime de teitset nah n dage langkegaime de tangtsu le samla kelade. Ih n namedung de daikenzwa gede hekwalu neu no nruipui pe namedung de pe hesiukang gage gum kela nzwa, dede nang au neu luma. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Ainie, n ki gi dida. Cine Ih n dage ranglia zie, nang acu ngaudai lakta, ‘Rampaube ziteu kegwangbe au samlam pungtu delie de rangkera ting gwangcang kemaktane.’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 118:26, Jeremiah 12:7</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Jisu Phariseeme ge ki ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Cu cinzwa eh Sabbath naige pa Phariseeme muiteume ge kiga matyei zielie lüt kelu dau, penui Jisu de pieling eh bam. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Cu pe dwaga mipei ge kemma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kemma: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pe pi pe ba hema kecu mateei.</char></note> mateei gade keherei kelame ge bam. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Cine Jisu Jewme hezaikecime nah Phariseeme de samkeli nah mpau eh, rang, “Hezai gade Sabbath benai mide teingkei kecu petau mi meno?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Dede penui mlei ma. Cine Jisu mina cipaude de deu eh teihemi beu, delwe pecu lang gidi. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Pecai pa penui dade rangdi, “Nnui caube pe na mede hetumseu ge bam eh cide tekwa gega Sabbath benai cak lütdi eh pecu zette teu mpet kelak bamno?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ge penui aidungde pe sam kelilu tadi.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Pecai pa cika qugai kebammedung dage samgwa rangbam, penui hebam keyi pei eh bam kedi ngau eh, penui dage ranggai, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Nnuide mi meunui ngyi gage qu kegai dau, hebam keyi ga bamdi so, pa mi n swade hetwapung ki kecu gede qu nzeu pwabam lubui lu, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />nah ncu qu kegaibe nah pa gwang cai, pa nda de rangzie, ‘Nbam aipaude de peulo,’ nah pecai nang ngngam eh hebam henatu ga bamdi zielu. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Dede nnuide qu kegai dau, gwang eh hebam henatu ga bamlu, iciude n giabe kegwang dau pa nda de rangzie, ‘Azangbo, kecehu ga nghang lulo,’ iciucai nang taktyei bam ga ncu ngngwa kebam peciakne dade hetwa punglu builu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6">Mac. 25:6</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:7">7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kedanemene keheibe de pe katei pecu tei mdi teu kelabe de tei henah dizie, nah cau pekatei pecu tei henah teu labi, cipaude de tei mdi beuzie.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Pecai pa pecu qu kegaibe dade de rangdi, “Nang tingmui taktyei mede matyei zielie qu kecu dau, nang nzangme mede n siname mede n kibaume mede n kida keheime de qu so, iciucai penuide ncu qu dai lubui, nah n pau kap daidi zie. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Dede nang mide ngngwa matyei zie cai, kegame, kennoime, keswame nah miakcietme de kulu lo, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />nah nang samlam pung luzie, kedanemene penui n pau kapdai gailak lu. Makesangme ringcuhdai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Makesangme ringcuhdai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maukemakme mede kemcime ketsai gade peu ringcuhdai kecu dau.</char></note> kecu benai n ziehi teibeu zie.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hengyi kedi ge samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Matyei zielie kebame hangge sam aidung siu kelu dau, pa peda ge rangdi, “Tinggwang hegwang gade ngngwa taktyei kerame samlam pungtu!” <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Dede pa pecu keligai, “Mige hengyi kedige telei lu, nah ci kage mina kekie de qugai. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Matyei kera tingbe cang gwang dige, pa qu kenzeume dungde rang kera pe kilame de langgai, ‘Gwanglu lo, ma peciakne mteilu delie.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Dede penui peciakne de tei daulak lie rangdi. Keraibe pe dage rangdi, ‘Ih luhpak ge lui pwa bam nah Ih mie cide pie maisia lie. Acu peu mielo Ih n dade a nggia kiela.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Nah kedage rangdi, ‘Ih hetumseu zura mengei lui pwa bam, nah Ih mie cide yimi siabi pie mai siareu. Acu peu mielo Ih n dade a nggia kiela.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Nah kedage de rangdi, ‘Ih a nau tei lu da, nah aide ziemne Ih gwang gailak ta.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Cine kilabe gwang pe mpaube dage ma aidungde pau gaibeu. Ge ki mpaube perata eh pe kilabe dage rangdi, ‘Renam puidi ki nah puiceunadung ga zette mie cu, delwe kegame, nah kennoime, nah miakcietme nah pisiamedung leude qu teu gwanglu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Ge kilabe rangdi, ‘Kedibo, nang rangkebeu nzwa teilu da, dede hebam bamreu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Cine pe mpaube kilabe dade rangdi, ‘Nang puidi nah puiceunadung ga mie eh minadung de gwang bilu lo beulo, ciude a ki tei puilu kerane. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Kedanemene Ih n dage ranglia zie, Ih qu kenzeume hangge de<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ih qu kenzeume hangge de: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Migede cau cika eh Samliakeyi de gidi bi kelilu lak.</char></note> hengyi mtei pwa kebam de msilak.’”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ledeukelume ketei mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Cu maadi ge Jisu de ngngwa ladi, nah pa nreu gwang penui dade rangdi, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Mina keheibe de ada kegwangme pe pei, pe pui, nah pe nau, nah pe name, nah siname, nah pe timedung, nah pekatei teilung de de acu keku swa kucai, pa a caisuime tei gailak. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Keheibe de pe katei pe krus pwa mene a caisui lade pa a caisuime tei gailak. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Kedanemene nnui caube, renei ge tei zielie kecu keraibe pa bamlu delwe, cide tei canglu kera bammi de kecu cetla kemak cau ge bamno? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Iciu mecai, pa pe bangdwa teilu eh teicang gailak dicai, cide kengaume leune pecu nui dizie, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />‘Aipau pei de pebang dwa cuh, dede teicang gailak dida,’ de rang dizie. <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Mede hegwang, hegwang keda gede ngngwa hereu tei zielie kecu dau, keraibe bamlu delwe pa mina cangkerei de ngngwalwe ngauraume peda gwang kezeu mina cangngkai de redau lubui mi mebi cet kemak bam no? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Dede iciu mecai, pa lube kemdei ga keladau ge, pa pe gwame de langgai eh peu kezuyi kera hezaidung kiegaila. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Cide nzwa eh, nnui keheibe de pegu maabamdung peciakne pütdi mecai pa a caisuime tei gailak. <verse eid="LUK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Cine mcai au yi, dede mcai pekum gahdi cai, dai pai le cide tei kum dailu lai? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Cide kideube ziemne de mede niara ziemne de pe keyi gahda. Penui cide keliengi dila. Kingnei kera pe kwen kebamme depeu kingnei lulo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Peu kingnei lulo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kingnei neu kelame de peu kiengnei lulo</char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Gahkedi meurün samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Cu heraha kehamedung pelane nah kemaumedung Jisu sam kingnei zielie pe da gwanglu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Dede Phariseemedung nah laisiukecime ncam bam eh, ranggai, “Aipaude kemaume de ngngwa nah penuide ngngwa matyei la.”<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Cine pa penui dage samgwa aide rang eh, <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Nnui kakga cau ge, meurün haige bam nah pa cidung gade ket teinggah dicai, pa riakhekui eh hekui de renaam gage kainzeu eh mie gahkedi nade de ngaulu kemakta peeila lak ni?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:11">Eze. 34:11</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 34:12">12</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 34:16">16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Nah pa cide ngau kelu dau, pa pesuiyi eh cide pwa pe hekeutu gage kailu la. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Nah pa kilung gwanglu ge, pa pe zangme nah pe kidamedung de qu hekwa lwe, penui dade rang eh, ‘Acu ngngwa nnui suiyi lulo, kedanemene Ih a meurünna ga kedina de ngaulu delu.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Cinzwa Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, makesangme hangriakhekui-hekui helungnreu maisia kemakme swade kemaume hangge helung nreu kelu ziemne tinggim ga suiyi kieeki zie.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gahkedi rangkanggeu samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Mede cau pui ge, rangkang geu kerei bam eh, magade pa ket teinggah dicai, pa mi mtau lwe kilung biak eh lungpang tei cide ngaulu kemakta peei lakni? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Nah pa cide ngau luge, pa pe zangme nah kidamedung de qu hekwalwe, rang eh, ‘Acu ngngwa nnui suiyi lulo, kedanemene Ih rangkanggeu teinggah kedide ngaulu delu.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Cide nzwa eh, Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, kemaume ge helung nreu kelu ziemne Tinggwang gwamedung de penui sui yila.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gahkedi nabe samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Ge pa rangdi, “Mige pena hangna bam, <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />nah henabe pe pei dade rangdi, ‘A pei, mabam a nzibe pwa acu peulo.’ Cine pa pema penaide nzibeudi. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Ma tingtie mene pe na henabe pegu keu hekwa kaplu eh renam kemdei gega mie di, nah pa cika de lungh pesuira tei eh pema teizang kapdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 29:3">Mac. 29:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Nah pa ma peciakne teizang kap dige, renam cika herakum kum cudi, ge pa maga bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Cine pa renam cika kelungme ge kiga mahi kera gwanglu, nah cipaude pecu hebak kwa kera peluh gage langgai. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Nah pa hebaktak de tyei nggei gaineu bamdi, dede migede pecu ma gede peu ma. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Dede pa pelung mraklu ge, pa rangdi, ‘A pei mi zie luilwe pe kila tei kebammedung daikieege de ketyeipok kepui teibam no, dede Ih aika de nzeu eh tsai lau da! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ih culwe a pei da gwang zie da, nah Ih pe dade rangzie, “A pei, Ih tinggim dwade de nah ndwa gade de mau dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Lei. 51:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Acu le pwa n na lie qulu dui da; acu mahi kebam n kilame ge nzwa eh ngngwa lulo.”’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Cine pa culu delwe pe pei da gwang. Dede pa kemdei ga kela dau de, pepei pecu ngaulu nah pelungsia eh pak gwang pecu tui pwalwe kemam. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Ge pe napei pe dade rangdi, ‘A pei, Ih tinggim dage nah n dage kemau teigai dida. Ih n na lie kulu kera bui meda.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Dede pe pei pe kilamedung dade rangdi, ‘Pai yitube keu kelwa gwang, nah cide peu pecu balu, nah bakap de pe ba gage kailu, nah pe picum de pe pi gage kailu. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Pecai hetumna pelui keyina de teu gwang, gilu, delwe anui tyei eh anui suiyi bamgo! <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kedanemene ana aide tsaidi, nah pa cu ringdai luda; pa gahdi dege,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gahdi dege: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilung gade tetdi, nah anui pa au daiga ladi bi ci luma.</char></note> pecu ngaudai luda.’ Ciciu eh penui penuisuiyi eh bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Cidau pena kecingbe luhga la, nah pa kilung mna gwang kecu dau, pa lei ketei nah helim kelim kwa siulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Cine pa kilame hangge de qu lwe aide daipai teizeu bi keteu. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Ge pa pe dade rangdi, ‘N caihereibe gwang bamda, nah n pei hetum pelui keyina de gilu da, kedanemene pa yimcang la eh pecu ngaudai kelu ziemne.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Dede pa perata di nah kilung nlüt neu ta di, cine pepei hegwale pet eh pena dade penggia kie. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Dede pa pepei sam keli eh rangdi, ‘Ainie, Ih mmi aikie ge n gwatei gwang, nah Ih nsam mzai tadi ma, dede nang madau de Ih azangme de ngngwa renga kera hemeuna gede acu peu ma, <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />dede n na aipaude n ma helipuidung de ngngwalwe tei ngkapdi eh lungh gwang, dede nang pe ziemne hetum pelui keyina de gibeu.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Ge pa pe dage rangdi, ‘Ana, nang acu ngngwabam muila, nah agu peciakne ngu ciakda. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Dede anui ngngwa taktyei nah suiyi bam kera petaulu, kedanemene n caihereibe tsaidi, nah cu ringdai luda, nah pa gahdi dege, pecu ngaudai luda.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kemriak kerengeibe samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Jisu pe caisuimedung dage maranglia si eh rangdi, “Makeheime ge pe ma kekwame ge bam, nah cipaude pe ma kehei teidi zeulie eh mi peda rang gwang. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Cine pa kerengeibe de qulwe pe dage rangdi, ‘Ih n ha kesiu aide ai daino? Nang manyia teu kela de pau mci gailo, kedanemene peu ncu hema kekwabe tei si lakta.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Ge hema kekwabe pekatei pecu mpau eh ‘Ih daipai tei zieno, a mpaube peu acu pe ma kekwa tei si lakta? Ih kideu su kera ngking ma, nah maha tyei kera Ih ngngam. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ih teimai kesiage cet luda, iciu eh Ih hema kekwabe tei tadi de, mide peu penui kiga acu ngngwa lu kera.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Ge hema kekwabe pe mpaube pau pung kelamedung hangge ge de qulwe, nah pa keraibe dage ranggai, ‘Nang a mpaube pau daikenzwa ge pung lano?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Nah pa rangdi, ‘Olive cabung haige.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Olive cabung haige: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cide olive litre 3,000 kenzwa ge</char></note> Iciu eh pa pe dage rang, ‘Nlaisiu keulwe bam kelwalu, delwe riangngei raulu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Iciu eh pa kedage dage rangdi, ‘Nang daikiee ge pungla no?’ Ge pa rang, ‘Wheat bung haige.’ Pa pe dage rang, ‘Nlaisiu keulwe riakheset raulu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Iciu eh pe mpaube hema kekwabe masangkemakpe de twagai kedanemene pa mriak eh peta keteine. Kedanemene kideube name au penui tingdau kebaabe namedung swa mriak ki kecune. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Nah Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, samsang kemak maheide de ngngwa zangna tei lulo, iciude cidungde gadi sangne, mi nnuide kelungta bam kela bamdung gage ngngwagai luzie. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Ma kecam nage gade kesamsangme kekiee gade de samsang la, nah ma kecam nage gade samsang lula kemakme kekiee gade de samsanglu lamah. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ciziemne, ma gade nnui kesangkemak mahei teu samsang la melie cai, cau nnuide mahei kesangbe pwa nlumbeu laino? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Nah ma gade nnui mi kedame gu teu samsang lula melie cai, cau nnui ba gage makai eh nnuide peu teu nnui gu teizie no? <verse eid="LUK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Kila hangge mi hangna gwatei gailak, kedanemene pa hangge de ngkau nah kedabe de ku, mede pa hangge kilam bam di eh kedabe de caudi zie. Nang Tinggwang nah kideu mahei gwa teida gailak.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Cu Phariseemedung, rangkang kehengim medung, aidungde leune siulu, nah penui Jisu de nuineudi. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Cine pa penui dage rang, “Nnui au mina dwade nnuide tei masang teu kelamedung da, dede Tinggwang nnuilung cibam. Kedanemene mina dwade tei mdi kelube au Tinggwang dwade ngkau kemneu ge kecune.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ledeusi kegaidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />John kegwang dwa hezaibe nah caihakecime ne heta tei gwang. Cipau cai au, Tinggwang hegwang samliakeyibe teu ledeu beu, nah keheibe de cika nsung lüt. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Dede hezai keceu nage de teicang kemak swa au tingkideu ga kedibe la kizie.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Keheibe de pe nau de tadi nah kedage de luucai mmha la dida, nah mige pe nahne ta kebeu puige de luucai mmha la dida.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keheibe nah Lazarus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Cu makeheime ge pe pai gieremang nah langcim pai bahlwe tingnai ramsangne lungh kehega süt bamla. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Nah ma kegah pei ge pezi Lazarus<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lazarus: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lazarus au Hebrewme sam, nah pekie be mipei ge kengha teumai kesia ge, kegame ge.</char></note> pe kirie ga zeubam, keteeizamle pui eh, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />nah pa ma keheibe taktyei bam gade tangra kemiebe de pa tyei neu eh bamla. Cirünne mene heteudung gwang pe mateei jamdung mniak bamla. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Iciu la eh ma kegabe de tsaidi, nah pe rabe tinggimgwame ne pwa gwang Abraham taiga ge kaizeu di. Cidau ma keheibe de de tsaidi nah kungdi, <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />nah Hades<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hades: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kemui, ci kemak, nah heni kesia ge, tinggim gade deisüt kecu, cika kemaume de tei keherei jüja bamla.</char></note> gade keherei süt eh, ngang cuh ge kemdei ga Abraham de pa ngaulu nah petaiga Lazarus kebam. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Cine pa sahbak eh cu, ‘Apei Abraham, acu ngau nggia eh Lazarus de langgai eh peu pecu dui gage pe zurangtün taulwe a mleu tei ngkung gai beulo, kedanemene Ih miheu aika de kehereisüt bamdi delu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Dede Abraham rangdi, ‘Ana, n kering tingdau nang makeyidung ngaukelu, nah Lazarus de cinzwa kesia ngau kedi de nsung lulo. Dede pa au cu aika relui bamdi da, nah nang au keherei bamdi da. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Nah cirünne mene, anui penai n kakga hekwa kecuk ge bam dida, cine aika de nnui lambie pet gailak ta, nah migede cika de anui lambie de pet gailak.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Cidau pa rangdi, ‘Ciciu cai Ih n dade a nggia kiela, a pei, pecu a pei ki gage langgai beulo, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />kedanemene Ih a siname hang mengei bam, peu penui de keherei bam aika gwang di melu kerane, peu pecu gwang rangbeu lo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Dede Abraham rangdi, ‘Penui da Moses nah caihakecimedung de bam; penuide peu penui kwa kingnei lulo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Dede pa keligai, ‘Ma, A pei Abraham, dede ketsai gade midungge penuida gwang cai, penui lung nreulu zie.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Dede pa pe dage rangdi, ‘Penui Moses nah caihakecime kwa kingnei mecai, penui ketsai gade mige nligwang de nlumlak.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Kempa gade ngkeikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Ge Jisu pe caisuimedung dage rangdi, “Mide teikemsia gwangme gailak, dede ainie caube dade gwang ziebi cipaude au teilu buida! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Pa hena keceu aidungde hangge de teimsia kedi swa au pecu pe ngwang gage keniaktsu kanglwe dui kedi gage kelien gaidi kecube yiki zie. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Nnui mriak lulo. N sinabe kemau tei cai, pecu kesiu lo; nah ma gade pa pe lungnreu lucai, pemau gibeu lo. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Pa ma gade tingnaige gage pia hena n dage kemau tei gaide, nah pia hena n da nreu gwang, rang eh, ‘Ih a lung nreulu da,’ de dicai pe mau gibeu di!”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Langkegaimedung Rampaube dage rangdi, “Anui kenlum tei ngkieng beulo.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Cine Rampaube rangdi, “Nnui kenlum ziegitsi pum lang nage de bam liecai, nnui aipau caimünbang dage, ‘Nang mlwak mpet lwe duikedi ga sap lu lo,’ debeu de cide nnui sam mzai zie. <verse eid="LUK 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Nnui mige pe kilame ge bam eh luh pu mede meurün kwala eh gwang de pe dade, ‘Kelwa gwang lwe taktyei bam ga ngngeilu’ de zieni? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Iciu meliene, pa pe dage, ‘A ziemne matyei kera mteilu, nah n kiakang kanglwe Ih matyei nah sak kebamdau a mapie bamlu, nah pecaine nang tyei nah saklude rangzie meni?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Pa teilo kebeu dungde tei kebeune pa kilabe de tei keherei delie zieni? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Cine nnuide teilo kebeube peciakne tei kelu dau, ‘Anui au kila teilu kebuime ma, nah anui ta nade rünne tei kelu lie,’” debeu.<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Cinzwadi eh, Jisu Jerusalem ga gwang keladau, Samaria nah Galilee cuikui kakga tetkah gwang. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Cu pa renam ge ga lütlu, ge kempame hangkerei pecu redaulu. Penui kemdei ga sap bam,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 13:46">Lev. 13:46</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />marang sahbak eh cu, “Jisu, Keledeubo, anuide ngau nggia lo.” <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Pa penuide ngaulu ge, penui dage rangdi, “Gwang delwe cingkumedung dage nnuide lialo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev. 14:2-3</char></note> Nah penui gwang keladau, penui yi ludi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:2">Lev. 14:2</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 14:3">3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Cidau penui hangge pa yi kedi ngau luge, marang sahbak eh Tinggwang de twa eh cailigwang dai. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Delwe pezu Jisu pi gage nkum pung eh pecu twa. Pa au Samariame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 10:33</char></note> ge. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Cidau Jisu samkeli eh, rangdi, “Mina kerei mcilu meni? Dede daiga hang hekuibe la di no? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Sang aipaude gwale kedame hangge de gwang Tinggwang de ketwa gade mi?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Ge Jisu pecu rangdi, “Cuhlu nah tetcu. N kenlum ne ncu teihemi luda.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggwang hegwangram kesang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Lang naige Phariseemedung daidau Tinggwang hegwang gwang ziebi keheteu dau, Jisu penui samkeli eh rangdi, “Tinggwang hegwangram au pe rehi ngau kegai gade gwang lak. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Mede penui, ‘Ainie, cide aika!’ mede ‘Luga!’ De ranglak. Kedanemene ainie, Tinggwang hegwangram au nnui kakga bam delu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Cidau Pa pe caisuimedung dage rangdi, “Mina Nabe tingba ziedung nnui ngau keneu tingbadung ge gwang zeu, dede nnui cide ngaulak. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Nah penui nnui dage rang zie, ‘Ainie, aika!’ mede ‘Lunie, luga!’ Dede pet so mede penui cai sui so, <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />kedanemene tingkehepik dau tinggim lambie gede hepik kaige kedale baa cailigwangdi kela nzwa, Mina Nabe kegwang benai de cinzwa zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiudung kesa ga</char><char style="fqa">petingba benai de bam,</char> dede laisiudung kesa ga bamma. </note> <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Dede keraibe pa keherei süt kecu ngau zie nah cudau ceheu de peu pecu mlai dizie. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Nah mina Nabe tingbazie daude, Noah tingdau nzwa zie. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Noah liem ga nlüt di kemakta au mi matyei masak, nah henautei nah hemeu meu bam eh duidi kegwang dau mina peciakne de kegak tset kapdi. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Lot kelung tingdau de ci nzwa da, mi matyei, masak, malui, mazwa, maling, ki de tei bam. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Dede Sodom gade Lot tet kempet benai tinggim gade mi nah mitseu ruimie eh penuide ngkap ciaudi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 19:24-25</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Mina Nabe mi miakngau tei kegwang benai de cide nzwa zie. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Cipau nai, keheibe de kireu ga kebamme de pegu kilungga kebam de peu keu zielie nhung so; nah luhga kelame de peu caili gwang so. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Lot nau ha nsung lulo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 19:17, 26</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Keheibe de pe teilung pwa pegu teilu neucai cide tei ngga dizie, dede pe teilung ngkap nggah kegaibe au cide kwak luzie. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, cipau ziude mi hangna zeu ga bamzie. Hangge de keuteu dizie, dede kedabe de au gidi zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">samgwame ne Pe minadung de ngngwa teu dizie penuide teu hekwalu kera. Mark 13:27 pie lubui. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Mipui hangna ngngwa maniak bamzie. Hangge de keuteu dizie, nah kedabe de au gidi zie.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiudung kesa verse 36 de si eh pei ncüt la. </char></note> [Mi hangna luhga lazie; hangge de keuteu dizie, dede kedabe de gidi zie.] <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Cidau caisuime pe dade keteudi, “Daiga, Rampaubo?” Cine Jisu penui dade rangdi, “Daiga hepaau bambi, cika heraruidung de ngkwa bamla.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 39:30">Job 39:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Rangbikedi hemipui samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Cidau pa samgwa ge rang penui dage dainzwa eh penui kiebam muilu maisiabi nah helung ceudi melu kerane, <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />rang eh, “Namdi ge ga hetuketiakme ge Tinggwang de hing ma nah mina de de mapei la kemakge bamla. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Nah namdi cika hemipui ge bamla, nah pa peda gwang bamla, rang eh, ‘A ngauraume dade a kum rangbeu lo.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Nah peting ketieege pa cide teineu mene la, dede kekamle pa pekatei pecu mpau eh, ‘Ih Tinggwang de hing ma mede mina de mapei meliede, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />aipau hemipui de acu keliau au lu, Ih pekum rangbeu dizie, iciude pa ada gwang sap eh acu kelei tset dilak kerane.’” <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Cidau Rampaube pe caisuime de rangdi, “Kingneilu, hetuketiakbe masang kemakpe kerang samde. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Tinggwang pane kedet kelume pedage tingmui tingba mra gai kebamme kum ranglak ni? Pa peting teuntie di zieni? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, pa penui kum rang zette beuzie. Ciciu de Mina Nabe kegwangdau pa kideu ga kenlum bam eh ngaulu zieni?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phariseebe nah herakesiabe samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Pecai pa samgwa aide de pwa mi penuikatei penuide le pwane masang lie mningkela nah kedame de malie la kemakmedung dage ranggai, <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Mi hangna kerecaki ga kekie tei zielie hang, hangge Phariseeme, nah kedabe heraha kehame ge. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Phariseebe pe ziemne saplwe aide kie bam, ‘Tinggwang, Ih mi kedame, keregame, masangkemakme, kemmhame, mede heraha keha aipaude nzwa kemak ziemne ncu twala. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Ih mtakkak ket gade piana mmwang la. Ih ma ngaukelu peciakne zi kerei tei eh zige kaibeu la.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Dede heraha kehabe, kemdei gage saplwe, pemiak de tinggim le ngang cuhgai neu mene, dede pe hekarak kepeu eh, ranggai, ‘Tinggwang, Ih kemaume ge, nang acu ngaunggia lo.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:1">Lei. 51:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Ih nnui dage rangla, Pharisee peide mene heraha kelabe pei aide pecu tei masanglwe pe ki ga nghung dida, kedanemene keheibe de pekatei pecu teimdi teu kelame de teihenah dizie, dede pekatei pecu teihenah teu kelamede teimdi beuzie.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Henamedung nah Jisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Iciu eh penui pecu peu hename de tung gai zielie peda ngngwa gwang, dede pe caisuimedung cide ngau ge, penui penuide kesiu bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Dede Jisu penuide petai gage qu teu gwang eh ranggai, “Peu henamedung de ada gwang lulo, nah penuide kaam helo. Kedanemene Tinggwang hegwangram au ci kenzwame gulu. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, keheibe de hename nzwa Tinggwang hegwang luulu mai cika lüt gailak.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makehei kedibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Nah kedime ge pecu keteu, rang eh, “Keledeu keyibo, Ih kelungta kering ngaulu kerane daipai tei maisia no?” <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Cine Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Nang daitei acu keyibe lie qu lano? Tinggwang gwale migede keyi gah. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Nang cibam samkai kebeudungde, mmha so, mide teitset so, rega so, kenret zierang teiso, n pui nah n pei de rütlu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Dede pa rangdi, “Aidung pekiene Ih a hena gade mzai la dida.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Dede Jisu cide siu luge, pa pe dage rang, “Nang mage cang mereu. Nang kebam peciakne zwadi delwe kegame de nzi beudi, iciu cai nang tinggim ga n mahei bamlu zie, delwe gwang a caisui lu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Dede kedibe aidungde siu luge pe suisiasüt di, kedanemene pa maheisüt kecune. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Cidau Jisu, pecu pielwe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiukecimedung samkie: </char><char style="fqa">[pa] pe suisia sütdi, de kecu de </char> aika kaimi lakbi kecu kesuisam luma. Pedum 23 de heda lubui.</note> rangdi, “Keheimedung ziemne Tinggwang hegwangram ga nlüt kera daihia ge pa no! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Kedanemene keheime ge Tinggwang hegwangram ga kenlüt swa au peu ut gede langhim miki gade kenlüt be relui ki zie kecune.” <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Ge cide siu kelumedung rangdi, “Ciciu cai caube debe kelilu zie no?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Cine pa sam keli gai, “Mina tei gai kelakpe Tinggwang dade teilu bui.” <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Cidau Peter rangdi, “Ainie, anui au ma pelane <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiu kesadung ga </char><char style="fqa">anui mabam,</char> dede laisiu yitubedung ga <char style="fq">ma pelane</char>de eh peila.</note> de gi dida nah n cai suila dida.” <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Cine pa penui dage rang, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, migede Tinggwang hegwangram ziemne pe ki, mede pe nau, mede pe siname, mede pe pui pe pei, mede pe namedung de gidi cai, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />aipau teilung gade ma kekiee, nah gwang kezeu teilung gade kelungta kering ngaugai kelak gahlie.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu pe tsit ha mrairangdai kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Nah pa kereiekenabau de teu ntsam lwe, penui dage rangdi, “Ainie, anui Jerusalem ga hangla dida, nah caihakecime ne Mina Nabe ha rauteu kela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Caihakecime ne Mina Nabe ha rauteu kela: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Messiah gwang kera rang nswa kelame, nah Samkak kehegwabe ga raupwa bam penui kerangdung de.</char></note> peciakne teicang luzie. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Kedanemene pecu Gentileme ba gage tui gaibeu zie, delwe pecu teu henui tei, nah hengam tei zie, nah pecu mcai msui lwa zie. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Nah penui pecu dap eh teitset dizie, nah lang pekecum benai pa ringcu dai luzie.” <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Dede penui aidungde kette cilu tadi, nah sam aide penui dade kebaidi, nah penui pa kerang samkie de cetlu tadi.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miakcit haketeibe mangaukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Pa Jericho namdi taiga mna gwang kezeu dau miakcietme ge lampuikung ga bamlwe maha bam. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Nah mina hemaabe kegwang kwa siu eh pa aide daitei au bi keteu. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Nah penui pedage ranglia, “Nazarethme Jisu gwang zeu lie.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Cidau pa sahbak eh, rang, “David napei Jisu, acu ngau nggia lo.” <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Nah mina keraile kelame pecu matu selo eh kesiu. Dede pa sah mteiki eh, “David napei, acu ngau nggia lo.” <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Cidau Jisu mtak lu delwe pecu ngngwa peda gwanglo rangbeu. Nah pa gwang mna kelu dau, pa pecu keteu eh, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Nang acu peu n ziemne daipai teibeu neu lano?” Cine pa rangdi, “Rampaubo, Ih mangau dai neulie.” <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Cidau Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Mangau dailu. N kenlum ne ncu teihemi luda.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Nah pa zette mangau dailu nah Tinggwang de twa eh Jisu cai suidi. Nah mina peciakne, aide ngaulu ge, Tinggwang de twadi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Zachaeus nah herahakelabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Jisu Jericho namdi ga lütlwe kahgwang zeu. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Cidau, cika mige pezi Zacchaeus<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zacchaeus: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hezi au Hebrewme zi nah cide pekie “mci.”</char></note> lie kecuge bam, pa heraha kehame reu kedibe nah pa mahei. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Nah pa Jisu caubi pie zielie piecu, dede hemaabe ziemne nah pa pera keduine, ngau luma. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Cine pa pak ntwa gwang nah pecu pie zielie caimünbang reuga nrahang lu, kedanemene Jisu cilam de kahgwang lai kezeune. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Nah Jisu heni cika gwanglu ge, ngangcuh pecu pie eh pe dage rang, “Zacchaeus, kelwa nghung lu, kedanemene Ih henai n ki ga bammai sialu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Cine pa kelwa nghung lwe pe suisüt eh pecu pe kiga ngngwa lütlu. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Nah mina pelane aide ngaulu ge, penui ncamdi, rang eh, “Pa kemaume ge gia tei zielie gwang dida.” <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Dede Zacchaeus saplu nah Rampaube dage rang, “Ainie, Rampaubo, Ih a ma pempie ge pwa kegahme de peu dizie, nah ma gade Ih makeheibe lede keheibe de cwa dicai, Ih ci mdai kieege peu dai dizie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:1">Tet. 22:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Cidau Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Henai ki aika kelikelu gwang luda, kedanemene pa de Abraham leuhme ge kecu ziemne. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kedanemene Mina Nabe gah kedime de peei nah kelilu zielie gwang.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Minas kerei samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Penui sam aidungde kingnei kebam dau, pa samgwa kedage ranglia si, kedanemene pa Jerusalem ga gwang mnadi zeu, nah penui Tinggwang hegwang gwang zette zie lie mningla kedine. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Ciziemne pa rangdi, “Kedime ge mie deudi kemdei gage de kengkieng ngaulwe ne cailigwang dai zielie tetdi. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Cine pa pe kilame hangkerei de qulwe penuide minas kerei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Minas kerei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kecak rangkanggeu kerei</char></note> peugai, nah penuide rangbeu, ‘Heli teilu Ih gwang kemaktane.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Dede pe leuhmedung pecu ngaurau eh hegwame gede pecai de langgai, rang eh, ‘Anui peu aipaude de anui reu hegwang tei neu ma.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Pa hegwang kengkieng ngaulwe nli gwang kelu dau, pa kilame rangkang peu kegai medungde pe dage qu teugwang lo langgai, ciude penui heli tei eh daikiee ge mmilu dibi pa ci lu kerane. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Iciu eh keraibe peda gwanglu, rang eh, ‘Kedibo, n rangkang zi kerei kieege pet ludi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Nah pa pe dage rang, ‘Teidau da, kila keyibo. Kedanemene nang makeceu nage gade de masang kelu ziemne, peu ncu namdi kerei reu kengkieng teizie.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Cidau pekenabe de gwang, rang eh, ‘Kedibo, n rangkang zi mengei kieege pet ludi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Cine pa aipaude de de rangbeu, ‘Nangbe namdi mengei reu zie.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Pecai kedage gwang, rang eh, ‘Kedibo, ainie n rangkang, Ih cide paineu gage kezui lwe kebai pwabam, <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Ih ncu hing di, kedanemene nang mina ketak kauge. Nang kai kemak gade de keu lala, nah linggai kemak gade de rumla kelane.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Pa pe dage rang, ‘Ih n samrang gade ncu mmau zie, kila kenlienbo! Ih a lung ketak kauge, kai kemak gade de keu kela, nah linggai kemak gade de rum kela nang cini? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Nah nang daitei a rangkang rangkangki gage kai meno, nah Ih nli kegwang dau, Ih pekai de si eh pwalu kera ge?’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Nah pa cika sap kebammedung dage ranggai, ‘Rangkang de pe dade keuteu dilo, nah minas kerei kebambe de peudi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Dede penui pe dage rang eh, ‘Kedibo, pe da minas kerei bam.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />‘Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, keheibe de kebambe de peu si zie, dede kegabe dade, kebam nade de keuteu si dizie. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Dede a ngaurau aidungde, peu acu penui reu hegwang tei rau kedimedung, penuide au aika ngngwa gwang lwe a dwagade penuide teitset dilu.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hecili eh kelüt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Nah pa aidungde rang cang dige, pa tet jüja eh, Jerusalem lege tet gaidi.<verse eid="LUK 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Cu cinzwa eh pa Olivet deutu lie qu kela, Bethphage penai Bethany renam taiga gwang mna keludau, pa pe caisuime hangna de langgai eh, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />ranggai, “n dwaga kebam renam ga tet lütcu. Cika nnai lüt de, gada ge mina ne madaude pereu ga cwa kemak nage keupwa bam eh ngau luzie. Cide hiak lwe aika teu gwanglu. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Nah mige de nnaide keteucai, ‘Daitei eh nnai cide hiak auno?’ nnai ainzwa rangbeu lu, ‘Rampaube teu maisia aulie.’” <verse eid="LUK 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Cine langkegaime mie nah penaide rangkebeu de nzwa bam eh ngaulu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Penai gada nade hiak bamge, pegumedung penai dage rang, “Daitei nnai gada nade hiak zeu no?” <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Ge penai rang, “Rampaube aide teu mai sia aulie.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Nah penai cide Jisu da teu gwang beu, delwe penui pai gada na reu gage kamlwe peu Jisu de pereu ga bamlu. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Cu pa gwang kezeu dau, hemaabe penui pai puidi gage kamlu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:13">2 Heg. 9:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Olive deutu gade tet kenghung lampui de pa mna gwang kezeu dau pe caisuime maadi penui suiyi eh nah miswakegah bata penui kengaudung de ziemne sahbak eh Tinggwang de twa eh cu,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zec. 9:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />rang, “Rampaube zi teu kegwang hegwangbe de peu samlam pungkelube tei lulo! Tinggim ga keyibe teilu nah ting hutu gade ndulu!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 72:18-19, 118:26</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Dede mina hemaabe gade Phariseemedung ge pe dage rang, “Keledeubo, n caisuimedung de kesiu dilo.” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Dede pa rangdi, “Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, aidungde mlei tadi de, tangtsudung de sah pet dizie.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Cu Pa Jerusalem ga gwang mna eh namdi de ngaulu ge, Pa cide ziemne hapdi, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />rang eh, “Magade nang henai de ci lucai, lungciep teugwang kelabe! Dede cu cidungde n miak gade kebai dida. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Kedanemene peting ge gwang zie nnui da nah n ngauraume ne ncu tsukwa kwa twagwa luzie, nah ncu kehei lam de twagwa luzie, nah ncu nyia ketangzie. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Delwe penui ncu nah n namedung de si eh kideu gage hekap gai dizie. Nah penui peu tangtsukang gede keda ge reu keswa pung bamlak, kedanemene ncu peei kegwang ting de nang cilu mede lu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kerecaki ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Pecai Jisu kerecaki kigu ga lüt eh cika ma zwa kebamme de pa gwa mpet eh, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />penui dage ranggai, “Kesanglaisiu ga aiciu rau nzeu, ‘A ki le pwa kekie ki tei zie,’ dede nnui cide pwa sütketyeime ki ge tei dida.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 56:7, Jer. 7:11</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Cine pa kerecaki ga tingba ramsangne ledeu bamdi. Cingku kedime nah laisiukecime nah muiteume pecu teitset di zielie peei bamdi, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />dede penui tei kera peeilu tadi, kedanemene mina pelane pe sam kingnei eh la kedine.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Jisu gu kengkieng ha keteukedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Langnaige Jisu kerecaki ga mina de ledeu nah samliakeyi ranglia kebam dau, cingku kedime nah laisiukecimedung nah hangkiamedung de ngngwalwe peda gwang. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Nah penui pecu keteugai, “Nang daipai kengkieng teu aidungde teila bi anui dage ranglia lo, mede caune kengkieng aide ncu peuno?” <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Cine pa penui dage keligai, “Ih de nnui dade mage keteu zie, nnui acu ranglia lo. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />John duipum keteibe de: tinggim gade mi mina dade gwang no?” <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Cidau penuikatei penui kakgade mpau bam eh, ranggai, “Anui magade, ‘Tinggim gade,’ decai pa, ‘Ciciu cai daitei nnui pecu nlumlu meno?’ de rangzie. <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Dede magade anui, ‘Mina dade,’ de rangcai, mina peciakne anuide tangtsu samzie, kedanemene penui John de le pwane caihakecime ge lie lalu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Cine penui dai gade gwang bi penui au cime lie de keligai. <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Cidau Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Ih daipai kengkieng teu aidungde teila bi nnui dage rang delak.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hetaketame samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Cidau pa samgwa aide minadung dage ranglia eh cu, “Mige kubetsi luhpak ge talu, delwe cide pwa kubetsi kenruime de peu di, delwe peting ketie ge deudi kedage ga gwang di. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Peting cangdi ge pa kilame gede lang pwa kubetsi kenruime dage kai, ciude penui pecu kubeluh gu petsi peu kerane. Dede kubetsi kenruime pecu dap eh mta langgi di. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Cidau pa kila kedage de langgai dai, dede penui pecu de dap nah hengam teisüt gai eh, penui pecu mta langgi di. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Pecai pa pe kecumbe de langgai dai, dede penui cipaude de tei rejam di nah pecu pwa kelien gidi. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Ge kubeluh mpaube rangdi, ‘Ih daipai teizie no? Ih ana akube de langgai zie da. Penui pecu au rüt zie ha.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Dede kubetsi kenruime pecu ngaulu ge, penuikatei penui kakgade resiu eh, rang, ‘Aide pe mapwabe da. Anui pecu daptset digo iciude pe mabam anui gu di zielu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Ciciu eh penui pecu luh gwale teu mie daptset di. Ciciu cai kubeluh mpaube penuide pwa daipai teidi zie no? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Pa gwang delwe kubetsi kenruime de ngkap dizie, delwe kubeluh cide kedame de peu dizie.” Dede penui aide siu luge, penui rangdi, “Ciciu di siabi!” <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Dede pa penuide piegai eh rangdi, “Rauteu kela aide daino:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Tangtsu ta keteimedung gi kedibe tsukang de, cide pe kimiaktsube tei bam dida’?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 118:22-23</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Lei. 118:22</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:23">23</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Keheibe de tangtsu cide reu ga cak kemieme de rüt pang dizie. Nah tangtsu cide keheibe reu ga cakmie cai cide pecu rüt kecai dizie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:34">Dan. 2:34</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 2:35">35</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Cipau tingsiak dau laisiukecime nah cingku kedime pecu tuilu neu eh cu, kedanemene penui mmau eh pa samgwa aide penuide rangzeu lie ci bamdi. Dede penui minadung de hing di.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Romme gwangpei de ceha kepeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Cine pecu ling bam eh, nah penui reketme de langgai peu makesangme rehi tei eh, iciu eh penui pe samrang kemau peeilu kerane, delwe pecu hezaibe nah deuceudibe kengkieng dage tuigai beulu kerane. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Penui Jisu dage keteu eh ranggai, “Keledeubo, nang kesangbe teu mi dage rang ledeu kela anui ci, nah heneuherüt tei lama, dede Tinggwang lampui kesangbe gade mide ledeu la. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Anui heraha Caesar de peu kecu petau mi meno?” <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Dede pa penui ciem cidi nah penui dage rangdi, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Acu dinarius ge keulia lo. Cika ge cau mie nah cau zi raupwa lano?” Cine penui rangdi, “Caesar mie.” <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Cidau pa penui dage rangdi, “Ciziemne Caesar gube pwa Caesar de peudilu, nah Tinggwang gube pwa Tinggwang de peudilu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Iciu eh pa kerang samde ziemne penui mina dwagade pecu tui gailak di, dede pe sam siupwa penui swaga eh mlei tadi.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ringcuhdai kecu nah laktak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Pecai Sadduceemedung kangge peda gwang, ketsaime ringcuh daila melie de rang keladung ge, nah penui pecu keteu, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />rang eh, “Keledeubo, Moses anui dage hezai rau kebeu ma gade mige pe swacingbe pe nau teilwe pe na lungh mene tsaidi cai pa pe naude ngngwa lung lwe pe swacingbe leuh mteulu maisia liebeu. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Iciuge caihereiswacing hang hena lage, cingtube pe nau tei luge pe na lungh mene tsaidi; <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />nah pekenabe <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />nah pekecumbe de cipau puide de luulu, nah cinzwa eh pehenabe de hena lungdiak mene tsaidi. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Pecai cipau puide de tsai di. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Ciziemne ketsaime ringcuhdai kecudau cipau puide caube nau zieno? Kedanemene hang hena baude pecu pe nau kap de kecune.” <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Cine Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Cudau name henau tei hemeu meu nah laktak tei bamla. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Dede caugamme lube teilung ga lunglu kebuime bi, nah ketsai gade ringcuh dailu buibi, henau tei hemeu meu mede meunui de teilak; <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Penui tsai dailakta, kedanemene penui au tinggimgwame nzwa kecune; nah penui au Tinggwang name, ringcuhdai kecube name. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Dede ketsaime kwak cuhlu, Moses ne de tsinghum ha de gade keulia da, cika de pa Rampaube Abraham Tinggwang, nah Isaac Tinggwang, nah Jacob Tinggwang de qu. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Iciu eh pa au ketsaime Tinggwang ma, dede keringme Tinggwang, kedanemene pe dade peciakne ringkebam ziemne.” <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Ge laisiukecime keligai nah rangdi, “Keledeubo, nang rangdau da.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Kedanemene penui sam keda gede pecu keteu ngngi kedine.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista caube Na no?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Pecai Jisu penui dage keteu eh, “Dainzwa penui Khrista de David na lie rang lulai? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Kedanemene David pekatei de Leidung Laisiukwak gage rangkecu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Rampaube a Rampaube dage rang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‘A ba zetle bamlu,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Ih n ngauraume de pwa n pidau teidi kemaktane.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 110.1</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Ciziemne David pecu ‘Rampaube’, qu, cine dainzwa pa pena lulai?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Mina pelane kingnei kebam dau, Jisu pe caisuimedung dage rangdi, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Laisiukecimedung dade mriak lulo, pai ketiedung balwe tetla neu, nah litaknidung gade mide peu penuide kelum neu, nah synagoguedung gade hebam yitubedung ga, nah hengyidau hebam yitube ga bamneu kelame dade. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Penui hemipui gu süt tyei lala, nah hezai tei eh kekie tei tie süt lala. Penuide au mmau kieeki zie.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Hemipui makai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Cu Jisu ngangcuh pie nah makeheime ge ma kehekwabung gage penui makai kai kebam ngaulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Pecai pa makegah hemipui ge tamrine kena kai eh ngau. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Cine pa rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, makegah hemipui aipaude mi kedame swa kaikie kilie. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Kedanemene aidungde pelane penui mahei kekiee gade makai kaigai. Dede aipau puide au, pe magah gade, pegu teu eh lung kera kebam pelane kaibeu dida.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tingtun zaisidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Cu midung ge tangtsudung keyi ruipwa nah mi makaidungle pwa kerecaki tei hezuyi süt kelu ha rangla, ge pa rangdi, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Kedanemene nnui aidungde ngau kebamdung de, tingnaige tangtsukang gede kedage reuga keswa pwabam kelak nah teimeu di mene bam kelak tingba gwang zie.” <verse eid="LUK 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Cine penui pecu keteu eh rang, “Keledeubo, daidau aidungde teidi zieno, nah aidungde gwang kera tingdau daipai rehi teidi zieno?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Ge pa rangdi, “Nnuide cwadi melu kerane mriak lulo. Kedanemene mina kekiee a zi teu eh gwang zie, rang eh, ‘Ih au Khrista da,’ nah, ‘Peting nna dida, cine penui caisui so.’ <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Dede nnui hereu tei kecu nah ma kehebwak kesiu dau ngngi di so, kedanemene aidungde teirai gwang zie, dede cide zette eh penli dilak.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Pecai pa penui dage rangdi, “Heleuh ge heleuh kedage de keregi, nah hegwang ge hegwang kedage de ngngwa keregi cuh zie. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Nah kideu luga aika nnui kedidung teu nah herakum kum nah rapiadung cuh zie. Nah tinggim gade ma nretkei ketei nah marehidung ngau dizie. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Dede ma aidung peciakne tei kedi dwa, penui nnuireu gage penui ba hwa gai eh nnuide mneu zie, nah nnuide synagoguedung nah hebaangkidung gage tui gaizie, delwe hegwangme nah deuceudidung dwa a zi ziemne nnuide teugwang zie. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Cide nnuide zierang tei kera zuiyi peu zie. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Ciziemne nnui lung gade dainzwa mi sam keli mai siabi de mrai cet nswa so, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />kedanemene Ih nnuide ranglu kebui samdung nah maci ngauraume nnuide rangkum gai kelak mede renia gai kelak ge peuzie. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Dede nnui puipei nah nnui siname nah nnui kibaume nah nnui zangmedung ne nnuide tuigai beuzie; nah penui nnui kangge de teitset dizie. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Nah a zi ziemne mina peciakne nnuide ngaurau dizie. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Dede nnui peutam leige de tei ngga dilak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nnui peutam leige de tei ngga dilak: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aide ranggai kecu penui au keherei dilak rejamlu kebui kehei gade de, Tinggwang pe mina de gumbeu zie.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Nnui liakelu gade, nnui keringria ngaulu zie.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Dede nnui Jerusalem de reugwame ne twagwa kelu kengau dau, cide renam ngkapdi kera ting nna di delie kecu ci lulo. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Cidau peu Judea deuzi ga kelungme de lamlwatu reu gage pak kailu, nah namdibe ga kebamme de peu tet dilu, nah deudi gwale kelame de peu cika nlüt so. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kedanemene tingbazie aidungde Kesanglaisiu ga rauteu keladung tei canglu kera, hekumkepei tingba kecune. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Dede ainie cidau ting nlaigailak eh kelame nah nepam kelamedung au reilu buida! Kedanemene kideu ga keherei süt kecu gwang zie nah mina aidungde da lunghopbe gwang zie kecune. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Nah penui kiengtie mui gade kau dizie, nah heleuh peciakne kakga hebaang teila dizie, nah Jerusalem au Tinggwang de ci kemak Gentileme pidau tei dizie, Tinggwang de cikemakme ting cangdi kemaktane.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Pecai tingnaimiak, hekei nah hegidung gade marehi tei pet dizie, nah kideu ga kelung heleuh leune keherei süt zie, nah jaaidi nah dui nswak kwadung ziemne penuide keheu sam pwabam dizie. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Kideu reuga matei gwang keradung cet eh minadung ngngi eh penui swagahbam dizie, kedanemene tinggimdung kengkiengdung teu nlai gaizie kecune. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Iciu eh penui Mina Nabe kengkieng teu eh nah ndusüt eh hemwa gade kegwang ngau luzie. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Dede aidungde teicuh kecudau, nnui saplwe nah nnui peu ngangcuh lwe pielu, kedanemene nnuide rilu kera gwang nna kedine.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Pecai pa penui dage samgwa ge ranglia: “Tangzütbang nah tsingbangdung peciakne de pielo. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Pecai penei bwapet herizi, tinglumting nna gwang zeu kecu nnui ngau nah ci luzie. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Cinzwa, nnui ma aidungde ngau eh tei gwang kezeu dau, nnui Tinggwang hegwangram mna bam kedi ci lulo. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, ma aidung peciakne tei cangdi kemakta aipau ceheude ngkapdi gailak. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Tinggim nah kideu gah dizie, dede a samdung au madaude gahdi lak.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Dede nlien nah sakmie kecu nah cudau teilung nangdung tei eh nnuilung naangbam melu kerane nah cipau tingba de zette gwang nnuide hekit teu di melu kerane nnuide mriak eh kwabam lulo, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />kedanemene cide kideureu ga kelung leune pelane da hetak nzwa gwang zielu. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Dede peting pelane mriak nah kekie tei eh bamlu, iciude nnui ngkieng eh ma aidung peciakne teigwang kera gade mbailu kerane, nah Mina Nabe dwa saplu kerane.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mina Nabe dwa saplu kerane: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ma kengkap gwang kebam de au tiak kerane “Mina Nabe gwang kecu” de rangbam</char></note><verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Cu Jisu tingba ramsangne kerecaki ga mide ledeu bamdi, dede pa tingmui tet mie Olivet deutu lie kecu ga bam dila. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Mina peciakne tingcang nuge peda gwangla kerecaki ga pe sam kingnei zielie eh.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Judas Jisu de tuibeukera samdaukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Cu Kahkegwang lie qu kela, Cehikaikemak Tangku Ngnyi de, nna gwang ladi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Nah cingku kedime nah laisiukecime dainzwa penui pecu teitset ziebi heciem peei bamdi, kedanemene penui mina de hing kedine.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Cidau Satan, langkegaime kereiekena mebau kakde, hangge Iscariot Judas lie qu kelabe lungga lütdi. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Cine pa mie cingku kedime nah reugwame reu kedime de pa dainzwa penuide Jisu de tuibeu lubui bi mpau. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Nah penui suilu, nah rangkang pwa pecu peu zielie samdau lu. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Cine pa samdaulu nah mina hemaabe kega gade penuide pecu tui gaibeu kera peting keyi peei ladi.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rampaube kensungtaktyei kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Cidau Tsehikaikemak Tangku Ngnyi tingba gwangdi, cika ge Kahkegwang Ngyi meurünna pwa ratak teila.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:3">Tet. 12:3</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 12:6">6</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 12:8">8</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 12:14">14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Cine Jisu Peter nah John de langgai, rang eh, “Gwang delwe anui ziemne Kahkegwang ngnyi taktyei mtei lulo, iciu eh anui cide tyei kerane.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Cine penai pe dage rangdi, “Nang peu anaide cide dai gage telei neu no?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Nah pa penaide keligai, “Ainie, nnai namdi cika lüt de, mi ge duibung ge pwa eh nnaide dauzie. Pa kenlütpe kiga pecai sui lüt lu. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Nah kilung mpaube de ainzwa rangbeu lu, ‘Keledeube n dade keteu la, “Ih a caisuime de ngngwa Kahkegwang Ngnyi de tyei kera daiga sangmebung mtei pwa bamno?”’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Iciude pa nnaide kibung nreube kedige telei pwa kebamde saubeu zie. Cika ge telei lulo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Nah penai mie ge pa penaide rangkebeu nzwa ngaulu. Ciciu eh penai Kahkegwang taktyei mteilu.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Nah pebamdakkakbe gwang dige, pa matyei kera taktyeibam ga bamlu, nah langkegaimedung pecu ngngwa bamlu. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Pecai pa penui dage rangdi, “Ih keherei kecudwa Kahkegwang Ngnyi aide nnuide ngngwa tyeineu süt la dida. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Kedanemene Ih nnui dage ranglia zie cide Tinggwang hegwangram gade tei canglu kemaktane, Ih cide tyei dailak ta.” <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Pecai pa hepiakbe keupwalu, nah pecai pa Tinggwang de twagai eh pa ledeukelume dage rangdi, “Aide pwalwe, nnui kakga nzi sak lulo. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Kedanemene Ih nnui dage ranglia zie, Ih cu gade Tinggwang hegwangram gwang kemaktane, kubetsi dui aide sak dai lakta.” <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Nah pa tangku de keulwe, Tinggwang de twagai eh, panglu, delwe penuide peu eh ranggai, “Aide a pum da, nnui ziemne kai kebeu de da. Acu kensung gade aide tei lulo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Pecai cinzwa eh matyei kelucai pa hepiakbe de penuide pwabeu, rang eh, “Hepiak aide nnui ziemne lwa kepet a jai gade samting samkakkelu kehecibe da, nnui ziemne lwa kebeude da. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Dede ainie, acu tui gaibeu kerabe pei de acu ngngwa taktyeibam ga bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Lei. 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Mina Nabe de Tinggwang ne mrai riemteu kela nzwa teicang zie. Dede ainie, mina pecu tuigai kebeube au teilu buida!” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Ge penuikatei penui kakga keteu cuhdi penui caubene aide teizie bi de kecu.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Caubene ditu ziebi kecu kesamlim kecu penui kakga de cuhdi. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Dede Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Gentile gwangpeidung au penui reu kedi teila, nah penui reu kengkieng teu kebamme de ‘Kenghame’ qula. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Dede nnui au ainzwa dilak. Meliene, nnui kakgade ditube depeu henatube nzwalu; nah pepeu keteube de, peu kilame nzwalu. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Kedanemene caube diki no, matyei kera ngngei kebambe mi pe gwatei kebambe no? Matyei kera ngngei kebambe de meni? Dede Ih au nnui kakga migwatei kebambe nzwa bam. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Nnui areidung peciakne ga acu ngngwa kebammedung da. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />A pei a ziemne hegwangram ge telei pwa kebam nzwa, Ih de nnui ziemne telei pwabam, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />ciu eh peu nnuide a hegwangram gade a taktyeibam gade acu ngngwa matyei masak kera nah nnui a hegwangbamdung ga bam eh Israel leuh kereiekena tutiak kera.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Simon, Simon, ainie, Satan ncu wheat nzwa gui gai kerane kiegai. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Dede Ih n ziemne kiegai luda, ciciu eh peu n kenlum de kaudi melu kerane; nah nang, nlung nreu gwang dailu sangne, n sinamedung lung tei ntiplu kerane.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Dede Peter pe dage rangdi, “Rampaubo, Ih au ncu ngngwa hebaangki ga gwang kera nah ketsai gade gwang kera mtei luda.” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Dede Jisu keligai, “Peter, Ih n dage ranglia zie, nang acu ci melie de kecu piacum rangdi kemaktane, henai nrui kwalak.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Pecai Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Ih nnuide peu rangkangbung nah nsung nah picum pung mene langkegai dau, nnui magede kenang dau ma, nnui kenang daudi ni?” Ge penui, rangdi “Magede ma.” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Pecai pa penui dage rangdi, “Dede cu, caube da rangkangbung bambi, peu pecu cide teulu, nah cinzwa nsung kebamme de peu nsung punglu. Nah cau pe kiengtie gahbi, peu pecu pe pai zwalwe ket luilu. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Kedanemene Ih nnui dage ranggai la, raupwa kela aide a dade teicang maisia, ‘Nah pecule hezai pungpang kelame de nzwa peilu da.’ Kedanemene a ha raupwa kelabe teicanglu mui kelane.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 53:12</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Ge penui rangdi, “Rampaubo, Ainie! Aika kingtie kena bam.” Nah pa penui dage rang, “Cide yida.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Olive deutu gade kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Pecai pa hegwale mpet lwe pezailui de nzwa, Olive Deutu ga tet gwangdi, nah pe caisuime de pecu kangzang gwang di. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Cidau penui heni de ga gwang canglu ge, pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui mdakkepie ga lütdi melu kerane kie lulo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Pecai pa penui dade tet pwa tangtsu kelien kegai dei ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">metre ngkaihena kenzwa dei ge.</char></note> ga petdi, nah kwaktung mielu, delwe pa kekie tei eh, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />ranggai, “Apei, nang nsui liecai, aipau piakde a dade pwa mbai dilo. Iciuliede a suibe mene, n suibe teilu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndame laisiudung kesa pedum 43 nah 44 pei ncüt si la.</char></note> [Cu tinggimgwame ge tinggim gade peda gwang, pecu tei ngkieng beu. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Pa pelungrei teupung eh kie laikai tei kidi, nah pe nlupdui hejai nzwa zau eh hangdeu ga miedi.] <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Nah pa kekie gade cuhlwe ledeukelume da gwang, nah penui zipbam eh ngaulu penui lungrei ziemne. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Cine pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui daitei zipbam no? Culwe kie lulo, ciu eh nnui mdakkepie ga lütdi melu kerane”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu de tuikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Pa marang bam kecune, ainie, mina hemaa ge gwang, nah Judas lie qu kelabede, langkegaime kereiekena gade hangge ne penuide ngngwa gwangla. Nah pa Jisu de kemam zielie nna pet. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Dede Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Judas, nang kehemam gele Mina Nabe de tui gaibeu launi?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Cu pecu ngngwa kelamedung daipai tei laubi kecu ngaulu ge, penui keteudi, “Rampaubo, anui kiengtie le pwa bizie mi?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Nah penui kakgade mige cingku kedibe kilabede bi ge pe kwen zetle bi tütdi. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Dede Jisu keligai eh rangdi, “Aiciu si talu!” Nah pa pe kwen deu gai eh pa pecu teingkeibeu. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Cipaucai Jisu cingku kedimedung nah kerecaki kekwamedung nah hangkiamedung pecu tuilu zielie kegwangmedung dage rangdi, “Nnui kiengtie nah cingpak pwalwe sütketyeime de tui kera nzwa gwangla ni? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Ih tingnai ramsangne nnuide kerecaki ga ngngwa bamde, nnui a dage nnui ba hwagai ma. Dede aide nnui bamdakkak da, nah kemuibe kengkieng da.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter Jisu de mlaikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ciciu eh pecu tuilu, penui pecu ngngwa tetdi nah cingku kedibe kiga ngngwa gwang di. Dede Peter kemdei gade pecaisui la. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Nah pecai penui kigu sumgage mi teilwe ntum twagwa bamge, Peter penui kakga ntum bamlu. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Cidau kilame pui ge, pa cika kebaa ga ntum kebam ngau lu nah pecu pielwe, rangdi, “Mina aipaude de pecu ngngwa la.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Dede Peter cide mlaidi, rang eh, “Mipoe, Ih pecu cima.” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Nah pecai matie mene mi kedage pecu ngau nah rangdi, “Nang de penui hangge da.” Dede Peter rangdi, “Minabo, Ih au ma.” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Nah bamdakkak ge caine de, mikeda ge de cu, ranggai, “Aipaude de pecu ngngwa la kesangda, kedanemene pa Galileeme gelu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Dede Peter rangdi, “Minabo, nang daipai rangzeu bi Ih cima.” Nah cidau zette pa rangcang gailak kezeu ne, nrui kwadi. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Cidau Rampaube nreu gwang Peter de piegai, ge Peter Rampaube sam nsunglu, dai nzwa pe dage rangbeu bi kecu, “Henai nrui kwa kemak dwa nang acu pia cum nlai dizie.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Cine pa hegwale mpet lu nah hap sütdi.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kekwame Jisu de henuiketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Pecai mina Jisu de kwa kebammedung pecu teu henui tei nah pecu dap. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Nah penui pemiak hezuilwe pecu keteu, rang eh, “Cilu! Ncu kezumbe de cau no?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Nah penui pecu ngaukerau sam keda kekiee rangdi.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Cidau tingbaa luge, hangkiamedung, cingku kedime nah laisiukecime gwang ngkwalu, delwe penui pecu penui baudi ga ngngwa gwangdi, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />rang eh, “Nang Khristabe liecai, anui dage rang gailo.” Dede pa penui dage rangdi, “Magade Ih nnui dage ranglia de, nnui nlum lakzing; <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />nah magade Ih nnui dade keteu de, nnui a sam keli lakzing. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Dede cu gade, Mina Nabe Tinggwang kengkieng ba zetle bam dizie da.” <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Ge penui peciakne rangdi, “Ciciu cai nang sui Tinggwang Nabe deni?” Ge pa penui dage keligai, “Nnuine Ih delie eh rang bam.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Nah penui rangdi, “Anui daipai zierang teu si maisia no? Kedanemene anui cide pemui gade anui katei siulu delu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Cidau hemaabe pekiene cuhlu, delwe Jisu de ngngwa Pilate dwaga ngngwa gwang. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Nah cika de penui pecu ngaukerau sam rang ndeudi, rang eh, “Anui mina aipaude anui leuhme de cwa kela ngaulu nah Caesar raha ha helo kaamla nah pa pekatei pecule Khrista lie rangla, nah hegwang ge lie eh.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Ge Pilate pecu keteugai, “Nang Jewme Gwangpei deni?” Dede pa pe sam keligai nah rang eh, “Nangne rangbam da.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Ge Pilate cingku kedimedung nah hemaabedung dage rangdi, “Ih mina aipaude dade kemau ge de ngau lumah.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Dede penui ketang si eh, ranggai, “Pa mina de kecung pwa eh, Judea deuceu pelane gade ledeu, nah Galilee deuceu gade ndeu eh, nah Jerusalem heni aika de.” <verse eid="LUK 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Cu Pilate sam aide siulu ge, pa mina aipaude Galileeme mi mebi keteu. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Nah pa Herod kengkieng kangga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Herod kengkieng kangga: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herod Antipas. Herod aide ne Duipum keteibe John de de teitset da.</char></note> kelungme lie kecu cilu ge, pa pecu langpwa Herod dage kai, pa cidau ting Jerusalem ga bam.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Nah cidau Herod Jisu de ngau luge, pa pe suiyisüt di, kedanemene pa Jisu de peting ketie ge ngauneu sütla kedine, kedanemene pa peha siukelane, nah pa miswakegah bata pecu tei liazie ha regui kelane. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Cine Herod Jisu de ma kekieege keteu, dede Jisu ma gede pe sam keli ma. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Cu cingku kedimedung nah laisiukecime petai ga sap eh, pecu mmau süt bam. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Ge Herod nah pe reugwamedung de pecu kii nah henui teidi. Pecu peu paiheni keyi teulu delwe, pa Pilate dage pecu lang caili beu daidi. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Ge cipaunai gade Herod penai Pilate ngngwa zangna teidi, kedanemene aipau dwa penai kakga kengaurau lala.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Iciu ge Pilate cingku kedimedung nah keda muiteume nah minadung de qu hekwalu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />nah penui dage rangdi, “Nnui mina aipaude minadung de pungpang la lie ada ngngwa gwang beu, nah ainie, Ih, nnui dwade pecu keteu da, dede Ih mina aipaude nnui pecu mmau kela nzwa pemau gede ngaulu melie. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Dede Herod de pemau ngaulu mene pa anui dage pecu lang caili beu da, nah ainie, magade pecu teitsetdi maikesia mau gede pa tei nzeu ma. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Ciziemne, Ih pecu tei keherei gai eh pecu lungmpet dizie.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiukwak kesadung ga verse 17 de pei ncüt la.</char></note> [Dede Kahkegwang Ngyi benai Pilate hebaangme hangge de Jewme dage lungmpet beu la.] <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Dede penui peciakne ngngwa sahbak eh ranggai, “Mina aipaude de ngngwa tet dilu, dede Barabbas de anuide lungmpet peulu!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Pa namdi ga ma kehebwak kauge nah mide daptsetdi, cine pecu hebaangki gage kaizeu.) <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pecai Pilate Jisu de lungmpet peu neu eh penui dage rangdai. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Dede penui sahbak eh, ranggai, “Gwaktsetdi, pecu gwaktsetdi.” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pecai de pa pekecumbe penui dage ranggai, “Daitei, mina aipau de daipai kemau ta ge tei nzeu no? Pa tsailu kebui mauge de Ih pe dade ngau luma. Ciziemne Ih pecu tei keherei gai eh, Ih pecu lungmpet di zie.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Dede penui rang mtei si eh sahbak eh pecu gwaktset dilo kiedi. Ciciu eh penui kwane ngkienglu. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Cine Pilate penui kie kelade peu zielie tiaklu. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Dede pa sorkari de ngaurau nah mide daptsetdi eh hebaangki gage bang kenzeube, penui kie kelabe de lungmpet beu di. Dede Jisu de au penui suibe tei lulo pwapeu di.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gwakkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Nah penui pecu ngngwa mie keladau, penui Cyreneme ge Simon deudi gade gwang la eh pecu tuilwe pecu krus pwa gaibeu, delwe peu pwa lwe Jisu caisui gwang.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Cidau mina maadi ge, nah mipuidung pe ziemne penui suisia eh nah hei eh hap kelame, pecai suila. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Dede Jisu penuide nreu pie eh, rangdi, “Jerusalem puimedung, a ziemne hap so, dede nnuikatei nnui ziemne nah nnui namedung ziemne hap lu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kedanemene ainie, petingba gwang zeuda penui ainzwa rangzie, ‘Hena kegahpuidung, nah tetlak kemak puidung nah mipui madau gede nepam kemakme samlam pungtu lie.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Ciciu eh penui lamlwadung dage rang dizie, ‘Anui reuga meumie lo,’ nah kideutudung dage, ‘Anuide gumlu lo.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Kedanemene penui tsingring dage aikenzwa tei gaicai, tsingtsai dage au daikenzwa ge teigai zieno?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Kemau ketei keda kena de, pecu ngngwa teitset di kerane ngngwa gwang.<verse eid="LUK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Nah penui “Mipeura,” lie qukela heni gega gwanglu ge, cika ge penui pecu gwak di, nah kemau keteime kena de si eh, hangge de pe zetle nah kedage de pe hile. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiukwak kesadung ga verse 34 de pei ncüt la. </char></note> [Dede Jisu rangdi, “A pei, penui mau gibeu lo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">A pei, penui mau gibeu lo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide cairasam de teicang kecuge Isa 53:12 ga.</char></note> kedanemene penui tei kebam de penui ci melu.”] Pecai penui dacak tei eh pe paini mzilu. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Nah minadung petaiga sap eh piebam. Kedimedung de pecu henui tei bam eh, rang eh, “Pa kedame de kelilu la. Pa Khristabe Tinggwang ne kedet kelube de cai, peu pekatei pecu kelilu lo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Lei. 22:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Cidau reugwamedung de petaiga gwang kehiadui pecu peu nah pecu nuidi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Lei. 69:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />nah rang eh, “Magade nang Jewme Gwangpei de cai, nkatei ncu kelilu lo.” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Cidau pepeu reu gage de, “Aide Jewme Gwangpei da,” de raugai.<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Pecai kemaume gwak kenzeu kena hangge paube pecu kii eh ranggai, “Nang Khrista meni? Nkatei ncu de nah anaide de kelilu lo.” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Dede sam keli eh, kedabe pecu kesiu eh ranggai, “Nang Tinggwang de hing meni? Nang de pa nzwa eh keherei zeu. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Nah anui au keherei kebam petau da. Kedanemene anai au anai ta ziehi ngau zeu. Dede mina aipaude au kemau ge de tei ma.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Cidau pa rangdi, “Jisu, Nang n hegwangram ga gwang kelu dau acu nsung gailo.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Cine Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Ih n dage rangsiakte liazie, henai gade nang kereluini ga acu ngngwa bamdi zieda.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Cidau tingna peting bam kereiekena di, nah kideureu peciakne ga tinghegi bam cum kecang mui bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Cidau tingnaimiak pe kebaa gadi. Kerecaki ga pailim de hak eh zina teidi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 8:9">Amo. 8:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Jisu sahbak eh ranggai, “A pei n ba gage Ih a rabe kaila.” Nah aide ranggai eh, pa pe ngi kamtube di. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Haireu kedibe ma cide ke tei ngau eh, pa Tinggwang de twa eh rangdi, “Kesang mina aipaude makesangme ge.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Nah mina aide pie zielie mbau kebam pelane cidungde tei kedi ngau eh, penui suisia eh penui hekarak kepeu eh kilung cailigwang di. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Dede pecu kecime pelane, nah mipui Galilee gade pe caisui kegwangmedung, kemdei ga sap eh ma cidung de pie bam.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Cu mige cika bam pezi Joseph lie kecuge, pa baudi ga peupei ge, hangkia keyi nah makesangme ge. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />(Pa baudibe de nah penuitadung de ngngwa kesuizwa ma.) Pa au Jewme nam Arimathea ga kelung mege, nah pa Tinggwang hegwang tei gwang kera kwa kebamme ge. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Mina aipaude Pilate da gwang eh Jisu paau kielu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Delwe pa cide lwak nghung lwe, langcim pai gage kezuilu, delwe pecu migede de madau gede kai kemak, tangtsu rau ge gage pecu pwazeudi. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Cipau nai Maketelei Tingba, nah Sabbath be ndeu lai bamdi. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Nah mipui Galilee gade pecu ngngwa mie kecume, perau nah pe paau dainzwa kungbi kecu ngau. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ge penui cailigwang lwe marim kehenguidung nah macadung pei hekwalu. Nah Sabbath benai mtaklu, penui hezai teikebeu nzwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Ringcuhdaikecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Cu mtakkak tingbazie raitu benai, penui tingcang nuge marim kehengui penui mtei keludung teu eh herau ga gwang. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Ge penui tangtsube herau gade nlet mpet kedi ngaulu, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />dede penui pelungga lüt ge, Rampaube Jisu paaube ngaulu tadi. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Nah penui aide cet kailak eh kebam dau ainie, cidau zette eh mina hangna pai rebaaha kecu balwe penui taiga sap di. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Dede mipuidung de keheudi nah penui keumie taksu penui zu hangdeu lebie bamdi. Penai penui dage keteudi, “Daitei eh nnui ringkelabe de ketsaime kakga peei lano? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Pa aika bam meda, dede pa ringcuh dida! Pa Galilee ga kebam dau dainzwa nnui dage rangbeu bi nsung lulo, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Mina Nabe de kemaume ba gage tuigai beu maisia nah gwak di eh langcumne benai ringcuh dailu zie,’” de eh kerang de. <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Ge penui Jisu samdung nsung lu, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />nah penui heraube gade cailigwang aidung pelane pe caisuime kereieket nah kedame pelane dage paubeu. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Cu langkegaimedung dage sam aidung de rangkebeu puidung cai, Mary Magdalene, Joanna, nah James pui Mary nah mipui kedamedung de si. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Dede cipau samdung de langkegaimedung ziemne kemta samge nzwadi, nah penui mipuidung de nlum tadi. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Iciu liede, Peter culwe, heraube ga pak gwang nah keumie piege, pa langcim kehezui pai gwale ma kedage de ngau ma. Cine pa ma cidungde ngau eh pe swaga eh kilung ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emmaus lampui ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Ainie, cipau benai penui kakde Jisu caisuime hangna Emmaus lie kecu renam ge Jerusalem gade kilometer kereieket dei ge ga kebam ga mie la. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Nah penai ma aidungde tei kedi hadung hangge ge de keresiu la. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Nah cinzwa eh, penai marang nah mpau pwa keladau, Jisu penaide gwang nna lwe nzang miedi. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Dede peu pecu cilu kera gade penai miak kezeudi. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Cidau Jisu penaide rangdi, “Nnai tet kegwang dau hangge ge dade rang keladung de daipai ha reki la no?” Cine penai cika sap bamdi, penai suisia rakke. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Ge penai hangge pau pe zi Cleopas keligai, nah pe dage rangdi, “Jerusalem ga kegwangme nang rünne cuting ma aidungde tei kedi ci kemakme da ha?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Cidau Jisu penai dage keteudi, “Daipai dung no?” Cine penai pe dage rang eh, “Nazarethme Jisu ha lie, mina aipaude caihakecime<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Caihakecime: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang dade langkegai keledeube.</char></note>, pa Tinggwang nah mina peciakne dwade pe sam de nah bata de disüt, <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />nah cinzwa anui cingku kedimedung nah muiteume pecu nim lwe mmau eh teitset dilo miba gage kaibeu, iciu eh pecu gwaktset di. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Dede anui au Israel de kelilu kera pa delie regui gwanglie. Cipau caide ma aidung pelane tei kedi, henai lang cumne dida. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Dede ci rünne mene, anui maagade mipuidung ge tingcang nuge herau ga gwang, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />nah pe paaube ngaulu tadi, penui tinggimgwamedung rengei, pa au ringdaidi delie rangbeu lie eh, kengau de rang eh cailigwang. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Cidau anui ngngwa kela mina kangge de herau mie pie ge penui mipuidung rangkebeu de nzwa ngausiak lu. Dede penui Jisu de ngaulu tadi.” <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Ge pa penaide keteudi, “Nnai dai miemie no, nah caihakecime ma pelane rangkebeudung de daikenzwage de nlum pa dino! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Khrista ma aidung de ziemne keherei maisia meni, delwe pe kendu ga lütlu kera?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Pecai pa Moses gade gwang caihakecime peciakne, pe ha raupwa keladungde penai dage ranglia Kesanglaisiu pelane gade. <verse eid="LUK 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Cidau penai gwang kela nam ga penui gwang mna di, nah pa tet mdei pet si kecu nzwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Dede penai pecu kaam eh cu, rang eh, “Anaide ngngwa bamdi lulo, kedanemene cu tinghegi dida, nah tingbazie be kekieele cang dida.” Cine pa kilung ga penaide nzang eh lütlu. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Pa penaide ngngwa matyei zielie taktyeibam ga ngngei keludau, pa tangku keupwa samlam gai, delwe cide panglu eh penai de peu. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Cidau Tinggwang penai miak ngkei beu, nah penai pecu cilu, nah pa penai miakngau gade tetdi. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Nah penai ketket dage rang eh, “Pa lampuiki ga anaide mpau kela dau, pa Kesanglaisiu gade anaide ma ranglia kela dau, anai mlung mi ne keru nzwadi meni?” <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Cine penai cipau bamdakkak gade cuh lwe, tet daipwa Jerusalem ga cailigwang. Ge penai langkegaime kereieketbau nah kedamedung de ngkwa bam eh penuide ngaulu, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />rang eh, “Rampaube ringcuh daidi kecu kesangda, nah Simon depeu ngau gaida.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Cidau Emmaus gade kegwang kenade lampuiki gade daipai teidi bi, nah tangku teipop keludau dainzwa penai pecu cilu dibi kecu ranglia.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ledeukelume de peu ngaukegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Cu penai ma aidungde rang kebam dau, Jisu penui kakga saplwe penui dage rangdi, “Lungciep be nnui da bam lulo.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Dede penui de keheudi eh ngngi sütdi, nah penui ma rabe ge de ngaulie cetdi. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Cine pa penui dage rangdi, “Daitie nnuilung keherei, nah nnuilung lunghau zeuno? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />A pi nah a ba pielo, cide au Ih delie. Acu deu eh pielo kedanemene rabe au pe teih pe ra gah, dede Ih au kebam nnui pie lulo.” <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Nah pa aide ranggai eh, pa penuide pe pi pe ba pwalia gai. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Penui iciude nlum luma, kedanemene penuisui yizu nah penui swaga zu kedine, cine pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui aika makeheibe de tyei kera bam mi?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Cine penui heka lang kelube ge pecu peugai, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />nah pa cide keulwe penui dwa gade tyeilu.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Pecai pa penui dage rangdi, “Aidungde a sam, Ih cu nnuide ngngwa kebam dauge ranglia zeu, cide a ha Moses zai gage nah caihakecime nah lei laisiukwak gadung ge rauteu kela peciakne teicang megai lak.” <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Iciu eh peu penuide Kesanglaisiu cilu kebui penuilung ngkeibeu, nah pa penui dage rangdi, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />“Ainzwa eh kesanglaisiu ga raupwa la: Khrista kehereisüt zie, pecai langcumne benai ketsaime kakgade ringcuh luzie; <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />iciu eh Jerusalem gade pe bangdwa teilwe heleuh leunedung dage pezi gade kemaudung gilu kerane helungkenreu paurwa zie. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Nnui ma aidungde zierangme da. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Ih a Pei kaibeu zielie sampet kebeude nnui dage langgai beuzie. Dede tinggim gade kengkieng ngaulu kemaktane namdi be ga bam lulo.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cuhkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Iciu eh pa penuide nzangpwa Bethany lebie gwangdi, nah pa pe ba hwacuh penuide samlambeu. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Pa penuide samlambeu kebamdau, pa penui dade tetdi, iciu eh pecu ngngwa tinggim nghang di. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Iciu eh penui, pecu reca, nah penui suiyisüt eh Jerusalem namdi ga cailigwangdi, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />nah penui peciakne kerecaki ga Tinggwang de twa eh bamdi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>